hadiths[316]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5979","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''us (deen ya khilaafat) ke mamley mein log Quraish ke tabey hain, un (logon) ke musalman, Quraishi musalmanon ke tabey hain, aur un (aam logon) ke kafir, un (Quraish ke) kafiron ke tabey hain.'' muttafaq aleh."
"5980","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''us (deen ya khilaafat) ke mamley mein log Quraish ke tabey hain, un (logon) ke musalman, Quraishi musalmanon ke tabey hain, aur un (aam logon) ke kafir, un (Quraish ke) kafiron ke tabey hain.'' muttafaq aleh."
"5981","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh maamlh qrysh myn as wqt tk jary rhay ga jb tk kh an myn say dw baqy rhyn gay[*]، mrqat، 5:508 as ka mtlb yh hay kh jb tk dw ansan zndh rhyn gay، khlaft qrysh ky mlkyt rhay gy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"5982","maawyh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh yh maamlh qrysh ka hay awr jb tk wh dyn pr rhyn gay kwyy bhy an say dshmny nhyn kray ga jb tk kh allh taalyٰ asay mnh kay bl alt nh day۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"5983","jabr by۔ smrh nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh \aslam barh khlfaa kay zmanay myn mzbwt rhay ga jn ka talq qrysh say tha۔\"" ayk wrzhn myn hay kh \""mrdwn kay mfadat as wqt tk jary rhyn gay jb tk kh an pr barh aadmy hkwmt kryn gay jn ka talq qrysh say hay۔\"" ayk awr rwayt myn hay kh ’’dyn qaym rhay ga yhan tk kh aakhry ghry aajayay awr an pr barh khlfayay rashdyn hwn gay jn myn say sb ka talq qrysh say hay‘‘۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"5984","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda ghfar kw bkhsh day awr aslm kw slam kray، lykn asyh nay khda awr as kay rswl ky nafrmany ky۔ *jysa kh brykt myn dyay gyay arby alfaz say dykha ja skta hay، yh tmam jmlay zyr bhs qbayl kay namwn say jry jrwn ka astamal krtay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"5985","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: qrysh، ansar، jhynh، mzynh، aslm، ghfar awr ashja myray mwlyٰ hyn jn ka khda awr as kay rswl kay swa kwyy srprst nhyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"5986","hzrt abwbkrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh aslm، ghfar، mzynh awr jhynh bn tmym، bn aamr awr hlyf bn asd w ghtfan say bhtr hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"5987","myn by tmym say mhbt krta aaya hwn jb say myn nay khda kay rswl say tyn batyn snyn jw myn nay anhyn an kay baray myn khtay sny thyn۔ myn nay asay yh khtay hwyay sna kh wh djal kay khlaf myry amt myn sb say zyadh bhadr hwn gay۔ jb wh apnay sdqat lay kr aayay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh yh hmary qwm kay sdqat hyn۔ aayshh rzy allh anha ky ayk awrt qyd thy jw an ky thy، aap nay frmaya kh asay aazad kr dw، kywnkh wh asmaayl ky awlad hay۔\ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"5988","hzrt sad rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs qrysh kw zlyl krna chahta hay allh asay zlyl kray ga۔ *sad by۔ abw wqas۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"5989","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aay allh tw nay qrysh kay phlay lwgwn kw azab myn mbtla kya، ab an myn say aakhry kw bhy skhawt ata frma۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"5990","abw aamr ashary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \asd awr ashar kay arkan achhay hyn، wh lrtay hwyay nhyn artay awr nh khyant krtay hyn، an ka talq mjh say hay awr myn an say۔\"" mrqat، 5:511، asd prhnay ky tjwyz krta hay awr khta hay kh asharwna awr asharywnh dwnwn mstaml hyn۔ as ka khna hay kh yhan phlay say mrad azd shnwh hay۔ lykn qrysh ky ayk shakh asd khlaty thy۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"5991","hzrt ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \azd zmyn myn allh ka azd hay، lwg an kw pst krna chahtay hyn، lykn allh taalyٰ an kw blnd krnay kay swa kchh krnay say ankary hay، yqynaً ansanwn pr ayk wqt aanay wala hay jb ansan yh khwahsh zahr kray ga kh as ka bap azd ka tha awr as ky man azd ky thy۔\"" trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"5992","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apny wfat kay wqt tyn qbylwn kw napsnd frmaya، sqyf، bn hnyfh awr bny amyh۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"5993","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sqyf an myn bht bra jhwta awr tbahy phylanay wala hw ga۔ abdallh by asmaa nay btaya kh kha jata hay kh bra jhwta almkhtar b hay۔ abw abyd [1] awr tbahy phylanay wala alhjaj b۔ ywsf[2] hsham by۔ hsn nay kha kh anhwn nay alhjaj kay hathwn qtl hwnay walwn ky tadad ka hsab lgaya awr yh ayk lakh bys hzar tk phnch gyy۔ 1. as nay kwfh myn mhmd abn alhnfyh ky hmayt ka dawyٰ krtay hwyay، mhdy anqryb zahr hwnay ka aalan krtay hwyay، awr hsyn ky mwt ka bdlh lynay ka mtalbh kya۔ asay 67 hjry 2 myn qtl kya gya۔ amwy gwrnr apny antqamy karrwayywn kay lyay bdnam tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"5994","mslm nay apny shyh myn byan kya hay kh jb alhjaj nay abdallh bn msawd kw qtl kya۔ zbyr asmaa rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn btaya tha kh sqyf an myn ayk bra jhwta awr tbahy phylanay wala hwga، anhwn nay mzyd kha kh anhwn nay bray jhwtay kw dykha hay awr an ka khyal hay kh tbahy krnay wala [alhjaj] kay alawh kwyy nhyn hay، rwayt ky mkml swrt bab III myn dy jayay gy۔ mslman"
"5995","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb lwgwn nay kha kh ya rswl allh sqyf kay tyrwn nay hmyn jhlsa dya hay، tw allh say an pr azab ky daa kyjyay، tw anhwn nay kha: aay allh sqyf kw hdayt ata frma۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"5996","abd alrzaq nay apnay wald [1] say mny ky rwayt say nql kya hay kh abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas thay tw ayk shkhs jsay wh qys ka smjhta tha aap kay pas aaya awr khnay lga: aay allh kay rswl، hmyar pr lant bhyjyn۔ as nay as say mnh phyr lya tw wh dwsry trf aaya lykn as nay as say mnh phyr lya۔ phr wh dwsry trf aaya، awr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay phr as say mnh phyr lya awr phr frmaya: allh as pr rhm kray yar! an kay mnh skwn ky batyn krtay hyn، an kay hath khana frahm krtay hyn، awr wh amant awr ayman walay hyn۔ hmam by۔ alhars nkhay ansar ka ayk gahk۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha hay kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay jsay wh srf abdalrzaq ky rwayat myn say jantay thay awr rd shdh rwayat as mnyٰ ky snd say mrwy hyn۔"
"5997","as nay btaya kh khda kay rswl nay as say pwchha kh wh ks qbylay say hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh wh daos say hay tw as nay kha، \myn nhyn smjhta tha kh daos kay ayk aadmy myn kwyy khwby hw۔\"" *yany abwhryrh rzy allh anh۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"5998","slman nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay khbr dy kh \mjh say nfrt nh krw awr apnay mzhb kw chhwr dw۔\"" as nay pwchha kh wh as say nfrt kysay kr skta hay jb kh wh wh zryah hay js say khda nay an ky rhnmayy ky thy، tw as nay jwab dya، \""arbwn say nfrt awr mjh say nfrt۔\"" trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"5999","asman b۔ afan nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \jw shkhs arbwn say khyant kray ga wh myry shfaat myn shaml nhyn hw ga awr myry mhbt hasl nhyn kray ga۔\"" trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay jsay wh srf hsyn bn ky rwaytwn myn say jantay thay۔ wh amr js kw rwayat myn mzbwt nhyn smjha jata۔"""""
"6000","am alhryr، mwkl، tlhh۔ b malk nay kha kh as nay apnay srprst kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \aakhry ghry kay qryb aanay ky nshanywn myn say ayk arbwn ky tbahy hwgy۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6001","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”badshahy qrysh ky hw gy، qanwny akhtyar ansar kay lyay، hbshywn kw azan dynay ka dftr awr azd ky wfadary، yany ymn ky hw gy۔ yh ymn ka qbylh azd shnwa hay۔ asay trmzy nay mwqwf shkl myn nql krtay hwyay kha hay kh yh shyh hay۔"
"6002","abdallh by mtya nay kha kh an kay wald[*] nay fth mkh kay dn khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh \qrysh ka kwyy frd as dn kay bad awr qyamt tk qyd myn nhyn mara jayay ga۔\"" *mty by۔ alaswd astyaab، s۔ 282، btata hay kh as ka nam alaas tha، lykn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay bdl kr mtya (frmanbrdar) rkh dya، yh khtay hwyay kh myn nafrman nhyn hwn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6003","abw nwfl maawyh bn mslm nay byan kya kh myn nay abdallh kw dykha۔ mdynh ky trf janay waly phary srk pr az zbyr[1]۔ qrysh awr dwsray lwg as kay pychhay say gzrnay lgay awr jb abdallh bn amr rzy allh anh whan say gzray jhan wh thay whyn rk gyay awr kha: alslam alykm abw khbyb، alslam alykm abw khbyb، alslam alykm abw khbyb! myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn tmhyn as chyz say mna kr rha tha jw as ky trf lay jayay ga، myn tmhyn as chyz say mna kr rha hwn jw as ky trf lay jayay ga۔ khda ky qsm kh myn janta hwn kh tmhyn rwzay rkhnay، ratwn kw nmaz prhnay awr rshth daryan jwrnay ka hkm dya gya hay، myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh jn lwgwn myn tmhara shmar sb say bra hay wh bdkar hay۔ ayk rwayt myn hay kh ’’achhay lwg‘‘ abdallh bn amr phr aagay brhay، jb alhjaj nay abdallh kay rknay awr as kay khnay ky khbr sny tw as nay abn zbyr kw bhyja awr an kw hthyly kay tnay say atar kr yhwdywn ky qbrwn myn dal dya، phr as nay apny waldh asmaa kw blwaya lykn abw bkr ky byty asmaa kw as kay pas bhyj dya۔ yh khay kh wh zrwr aayay gy، ya wh as kay lyay ksy kw bhyjay ga jw asay balwn say ghsyt lay ga، as nay yh khh kr ankar kr dya kh myn aap kay pas as wqt tk nhyn jaon gy jb tk kh aap mjhay myray balwn say ghsytnay kay lyay ksy kw nh bhyjyn، awr wh jldy say chla gya، phr jb as nay dshmn kw dykha، tw as nay kha: as nay jwab dya kh myn smjhty hwn kh tm nay as kay dnyawy mfadat kw khrab kr dya hay awr as nay aakhrt myn tmharay mfadat kw khrab kr dya hay۔ myn nay sna hay kh aap asay dw kmr bndwn waly awrt ka byta khh kr mkhatb kr rhay thay۔ myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn wh awrt hwn js kay dw kmrbnd hyn jn myn say ayk myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr hzrt abwbkr rzy allh anh kay khanay kw janwrwn ky dstrs say dwr bandhnay kay lyay astamal kya tha awr dwsra wh kmrbnd hay js say kwyy awrt nhyn atar skty۔ khda kay rswl nay hmyn btaya kh sqyf an myn ayk bra jhwta awr tbahy phylanay wala hwga، awr myn smjhta hwn kh tbahy krnay wala tyray swa kwyy nhyn hay۔\ phr wh atha awr asay chhwr dya، awr as say mzyd kchh nh kha۔ jw lwg as trh kay achhay aadmy kw an myn say bdtryn smjhtay hyn wh as kay many kw mwr dyta hay، yh btata hay kh jn lwgwn myn wh sb say bra hay wh bht achha hwna chahyay۔"""""
"6004","nafa nay byan kya kh khanh jngy kay dwran dw aadmy abn amr kay pas aayay۔ abn zbyr rzy allh anh nay kha kh lwgwn nay why kya jw tm dykh rhay hw awr tm amr kay bytay awr rswl allh kay sathy hw، tw tmhyn nklnay say ks chyz nay rwka hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh jw chyz mjhay rwkty hay wh yh hay kh khda nay mjh pr apnay mslman bhayy ka khwn bhana hram qrar dya hay۔ anhwn nay pwchha kh kya allh taalyٰ nay yh nhyn kha hay kh \awr an say as wqt tk lrw jb tk kh kwyy akhtlaf nh hw[2]\""، js pr abn amr nay jwab dya، \""hm as wqt tk lrtay rhay jb tk kh akhtlaf nh hw awr dyn allh ka hw، lykn tm as lyay lrna chahtay hw kh akhtlaf hw awr dyn khda kay swa ksy awr ka hw۔\"" yany bghawt myn qraan؛ 2:193، 8:39 bkhary nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6005","abwhryrh nay kha kh tfyl bn۔ amrw aldwsy allh kay rswl kay pas aaya awr kha kh daos fna hw gyay، anhwn nay nafrmany ky awr ankar kya، as lyay allh say an kw azab day۔ lwgwn ka khyal tha kh wh aysa kray ga، lykn as nay kha، \aay khda، daos kw hdayt day awr an kw lay aayay[*]۔ *myrqat 5:517، as ka mtlb yh hay kh ya tw anhyn hjrt krkay mdynh lana hay ya anhyn aslam ky ataat myn lana hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6006","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”arbwn say tyn wjh say mhbt krw، kywnkh myn arb hwn، qraan arby hay awr ahl jnt arby bwlyn gay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"6007","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray shabh kw bra bhla nh khw، kywnkh agr tm myn say kwyy ahd kay brabr swna sdqh kray ga tw wh an myn say ksy ayk kay md ya as kay aadhay md kay brabr nhyn hwga۔ * shabh kram ky dwsray mslmanwn pr fzylt ky nshandhy krna۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6008","abw brdh rzy allh anh nay apnay wald say rwayt ky kh anhwn nay، yany rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apna sr aasman ky trf athaya، jw an ka mamwl tha، awr frmaya: staray aasman kay lyay hfazt ka zryah hyn، awr jb staray chlay jayyn gay tw wh chyz aa jayay gy js say aasman kw khtrh hay، myn apnay sathywn kay lyay slamty ka zryah hwn، awr jb myn whan say nklwn ga tw myray sathywn ky hfazt kay lyay myray sathywn kw khtrh lahq hw ga۔ lwgw awr jb myray sathy chlay jayyn gay js chyz say myry qwm kw draya ja rha hay wh an kay pas aayay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6009","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn pr ayk zmanh aanay wala hay jb ayk jmaat jng kay lyay jayay gy awr an say pwchha jayay ga kh kya an myn kwyy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathy hay، awr jb wh jwab dyn gay kh wh hyn tw anhyn fth dy jayay gy، phr lwgwn pr ayk zmanh aanay wala hay jb ayk grwh jng kay lyay jayay ga، awr jb an say pwchha jayay ga kh kya an myn say kwyy rswl allh kay sathy hay؟ jwab dyn kh hyn، an kw fth dy jayay gy، phr ansanwn pr ayk aysa wqt aanay wala hay jb lwgwn ky ayk jmaat jng kay lyay jayay gy، awr jb an say pwchha jayay ga kh kya an myn say kwyy aysa hay jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay shabh say talq rkhta hw، awr jwab dyn kh an kw fth hasl hw gy۔\ (bkhary w mslm) mslm ky ayk rwayt myn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh ansanwn pr ayk wqt aanay wala hay jb an myn say ayk ghzwh rwanh kya jayay ga awr jb an say pwchha jayay ga kh kya an myn say kwyy rswl allh kay sathy kw pata hay awr kwyy ml jata hay tw anhyn fth dy jayay gy، phr dwsry ghzwh bhyjy jayay gy، awr jb an say pwchha jayay ga kh kya kwyy rswl allh kay sathy hay awr wh kwn hay؟ phr an kw fth dy jayay gy awr lwgwn say kha jayay ga kh an myn kwyy bhy shaml hay js nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay shabh kw dykha hay awr phr lwgwn say kha jayay ga kh wh ksy kw bhy dykhay js nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kay shabh kw dykha hw ya nhyn؟ mslman"""""
"6010","amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh \myry amt myn sb say bhtr myry nsl hay، phr an kay qryby pyrwkar، phr an kay qryby pyrw، an kay bad aysay lwg hwn gay jw bghyr pwchhay gwahy dyn gay، jw khyant krnay walay hwn gay awr an pr bhrwsh nhyn kya jayay ga، jw nzr manyn gay jsay wh pwra nhyn kryn gay، jn myn mwtapa zahr hw ga۔\"" ayk wrzhn myn hay \""wh hlf athayyn gay bghyr aysa krnay kw kha jayay ga۔\"" *mrqat 5:520 f، as ky mkhtlf wzahtyn krta hay، jn myn bla jwaz fkhr، shraft kay najayz daway، dwlt ka hswl، khanay pynay ky frawany، dyny frayz myn kwtahy shaml hyn۔ yh wazh twr pr kchh ghyr atmynan bkhsh khswsyt hay js ka mqsd hay۔ tjwyz krdh mkhtlf maany kw ykja kya ja skta hay kh as kay many achhy zndgy kay twr pr smjhay jayyn jw mzhb kw nzrandaz krnay ka baas bntay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6011","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh \phr jw lwg bwld pn kw psnd krtay hyn wh an kay bad hwn gay۔\"" mslman"""""
"6012","hzrt amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myray sathywn ky tazym krw، kywnkh wh tm myn say bhtryn hyn، phr an ky pyrwy krnay walay fwraً، phr an ky pyrwy krnay walay fwraً، phr jhwt as trh zahr hw jayay ga kh aadmy qsmyn khayay ga، bghyr pwchhay gwahy day ga، jw shkhs jnt kay balkl bych myn jana chahay ga، wh jnt kay lyay bht dwr hay، lykn as kay lyay jnt kay lyay akyla hay۔ mrd kw awrt kay sath tnha nhyn hwna chahyay، kywnkh shytan as kay achhay kamwn say khwsh hwta hay awr as ky brayywn say naraz hwta hay، js myn najayz fkhr، shraft kay najayz daway، mal w dwlt ka hswl، khanay pynay ky chyzwn say ghflt brty jaty hay۔ tjwyz krdh mkhtlf maany kw mla kr as kay many achhy zndgy kay twr pr pysh kyay jasktay hyn jw kh ayk mwmn hay۔ ... asay mntql kya. mshkw myn msdr kw chhwr dya gya hay۔ mrqat، 5:521 khtay hyn kh asay nsayy nay nql kya hay۔ myn nay asay nsayy myn nhyn dryaft kya hay، lykn rwayt ka ayk nskhh hay js myn mkhtlf tfsylat hyn lykn trmzy، ftan، 7 myn alfaz myn thwra sa akhtlaf hay۔"
"6013","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jhnm as mslman kw nhyn chhwyay gy js nay mjhay dykha hw ya js nay mjhay dykha hw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6014","abdallh by mghfl say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \myray sathywn kay baray myn khda say drw، myray sathywn kay baray myn khda say drw، awr myray janay kay bad an kw nshanh nh bnayyn، jw an say mhbt krta hay wh myry mhbt say krta hay، awr jw an say dshmny krta hay wh mjh say nfrt krta hay، js nay anhyn tklyf dy as nay mjhay zkhmy kya، js nay mjhay tklyf dy، as nay khda kw jld azab dya، awr allh asay jld azab day ga۔\"" *as say mrad an pr tnqyd krna awr an kw bra bhla khna hay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6015","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt myn myray ashab khanay myn nmk ky trh hyn، kywnkh khana tb hy achha hay jb as myn nmk hw۔ alhsn [*] nay kha kh hmara nmk khtm hw gya tw hm kysay achhay hw sktay hyn؟ *yany alhsn albsry yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"6016","abdallh by brydh nay byan kya kh an kay wald nay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ka yh qwl nql kya hay kh \myray sathywn myn say kwyy bhy aysy srzmyn myn nhyn mray ga jb wh qyamt kay dn as kay lwgwn kay lyay pyshwa awr nwr nh hw\""۔ trmzy nay asay ghryb rwayt khtay hwyay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6017","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm lwgwn kw dykhtay hw jw myray shabh kw galy dytay hyn tw khtay hyn kh tmharay bdtryn lwgwn pr allh ky lant hw“۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6018","amr by alkhtab nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh as nay apnay rb say apny wfat kay bad apnay shabh kay drmyan akhtlaf kay baray myn pwchha tha awr why mwswl hwyy thy، \tmharay sathy mhmd، myray andazay myn aasman kay starwn ky hysyt myn hyn، kchh dwsrwn say zyadh mzbwt، lykn sb ky rwshny hay، lhza، myn asay smjhta hwn jw hr as chyz kw drst smjhta hay js myn wh akhtlaf krtay hyn\""۔ anhwn nay yh bhy btaya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya kh myray ashab starwn ky mannd hyn، an myn say js kw bhy nql krw gay hdayt pao gay۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6019","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay mjh pr sb say zyadh skhawt ky hay wh abwbkr rzy allh anh hyn، awr agr myn ksy kw dwst bnata tw abwbkr kw dwst bnata، lykn hmaray drmyan akhwt awr aslam ky mhbt hay، msjd myn kwyy drwazh nhyn chhwrna chahyay swayay abwbkr rzy allh anh kay۔ ayk nskhh hay \agr myn apnay rb kay alawh ksy awr kw dwst bnaon tw abwbkr kw dwst bnaon ga۔\"" *abwbkr kw namzd krnay kay bad bkhary nay abwbkr kw prha۔ yh zyadh mamwl ky bat hwgy، jysa kh yh ana ky pyrwy krta hay، lykn sfhh 18 dykhyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6020","abdallh by msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr myn ksy kw dwst bnata tw abwbkr rzy allh anh kw dwst bnata، lykn wh myray bhayy awr myray sathy hyn، awr allh nay aap kay sathy kw dwst bnaya hay۔ *yany khwd nby sly allh alyh wslm۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6021","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh an ky bymary kay dwran rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya kh mjhay abwbkr، apnay wald awr apnay bhayy kw blao، takh myn ayk dstawyz lkhwn، kywnkh mjhay dr hay kh kwyy myry janshyny ka khwahsh mnd hw awr kwyy shkhs apnay lyay bay jwaz dawyٰ kray، halankh allh awr mwmnyn kay pas abwbkr kay swa kwyy nhyn hay۔ 3. lfzy twr pr، \myn khh skta hwn\""۔ Pt 17 mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6022","alhmydy ky ktab myn \myray pas sb say zyadh hq hay\"" kay bjayay \""apnay lyay ghyr mnsfanh daway krna\"" hay۔ jbyr by۔ mtam nay byan kya kh ayk awrt aayy awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say ksy maamlay kay baray myn bat ky، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay ksy awr bar waps aanay ka hkm dya tw as nay kha: \""khda kay rswl، mjhay btayyn kh agr myn aaon awr aap kw nh pawn tw kya krwn؟\"" awr aysa lgta tha jysay as ka mtlb hay kh wh mr gya hay۔ as nay jwab dya kh agr tm mjhay nh pao tw abwbkr kay pas jao۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6023","amrw by alaas rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ght alslsl ky trf lshkr ka srbrah bna kr bhyja tw aap sly allh alyh wslm an kay pas gyay awr an say pwchha kh aap kw lwgwn myn say kwn zyadh psnd hay؟ as kay jwab myn kh yh aayshh rzy allh anha hyn، as nay kha kh myn mrdwn ky trf asharh kr rha hwn، awr as nay jwab dya kh yh an kay wald hyn۔ as nay pwchha kh as kay bad kwn aaya، jb as nay jwab dya kh yh amr rzy allh anh hyn awr kchh aadmywn ky gnty krnay gyay tw as khwf say as say mzyd nhyn pwchha kh khyn wh an kw an myn say aakhry myn nh kr day۔ *8 hjry myn (bkhary w mslm)"
"6024","mhmd by hnfyh nay byan kya kh jb anhwn nay apnay wald say pwchha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay bad sb say afzl kwn hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh yh abwbkr hyn۔ as nay pwchha kh aagay kwn aaya tw as nay jwab dya kh yh amr rzy allh anh hyn۔ jb wh drta tha kh wh asman ka aagay zkr kray ga tw as nay mshwrh dya kh as kay bad an kay wald khwd aayyn، lykn as nay jwab dya kh myn mslmanwn myn srf ayk aadmy hwn۔ *wh aly bn abw talb kay bytay thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6025","rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn hm nay ksy ka mwaznh abwbkr say nhyn kya۔ as kay bad amr awr phr asman aayay۔ as kay bad hm nby sly allh alyh wslm kay sathywn kw chhwr dyn gay awr ksy kw dwsrwn pr brtr nh smjhyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ abwdaod ky ayk rwayt myn hay kh anhwn nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm zndh thay tw hm kha krtay thay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm ky amt myn sb say afzl aap kay bad abwbkr، phr amr، phr asman rzy allh anh thay۔"
"6026","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: abwbkr kay alawh ksy nay myry mdd nhyn ky، kywnkh as nay mjhay wh mdd dy hay jw allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as kay lyay kray ga، ksy kay mal nay mjhay abwbkr kay jtna faydh nhyn phnchaya، awr agr myn ksy kw dwst bnata tw abwbkr kw dwst bnata، lykn allh tmhara dwst hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6027","abwbkr hmaray srdar hyn، hm myn sb say achhay hyn awr hm myn say wh hyn jw allh kay rswl kw sb say zyadh pyaray hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6028","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abwbkr rzy allh anh say frmaya kh tm ghar myn myray sathy thay awr hwz myn myray sathy hw gay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6029","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as qwm kay lyay mnasb nhyn kh jn myn abwbkr rzy allh anh ky qyadt kwyy awr kray۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6030","rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn sdqh dynay ka hkm dya awr aysa hy hwa jb myray pas kchh mal tha myn nay kha kh agr myn ksy dn abwbkr say aagay nkl jaon tw aaj hy krwn ga۔ myn apny aadhy jayydad lay kr aaya awr jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh myn nay apnay ghr walwn kay lyay kya rkha hay tw myn nay btaya kh atny hy rqm myn nay rkhy hay۔ abwbkr rzy allh anh apnay pas jw kchh tha wh lay aayay awr jb an say pwchha kh aap nay apnay ghr walwn kay lyay kya rkha hay tw as nay jwab dya kh myn nay allh awr as kay rswl kw an kay lyay rkha hay۔ myn nay phr kha، \myn kbhy bhy ksy chyz myn as say aagay nhyn jaon ga۔\"" asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"6031","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh abwbkr rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay jnhwn nay kha kh aap allh kay jhnm say aazad hwnay walay hyn، as lyay aap ka nam atyq rkha gya۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6032","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn phla hwn js say zmyn pht jayay gy، phr abwbkr awr phr amr، phr myn an lwgwn kay pas aaon ga jw bqya myn mdfwn hyn awr anhyn myray sath jma kya jayay ga، as kay bad myn ahl mkh ka antzar krwn ga takh dw shhrwn kay bashndwn myn jma hw jaon“۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6033","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jbrayyl alyh alslam aayay awr myra hath pkr kr mjhay jnt ka wh drwazh dkhaya js say myry amt dakhl hw gy۔ abwbkr nay phr kha: \khda kay rswl، kash myn aap kay sath hwta takh myn asay dykhta js pr khda kay rswl nay jwab dya، \""abwbkr، aap myry amt myn say phlay jnt myn dakhl hwn gay۔\"" abw daod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6034","jb hzrt abwbkr rzy allh anh ka zkr amr rzy allh anh kay samnay aaya tw wh rw pray awr khnay lgay kh kash myry tmam nykyan ayk dn awr ayk khas rat myn kyay gyay aamal say mwaznh kr skyn، wh rat wh thy js myn wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ghar ky trf gyay awr jb wh whan phnchay tw kha kh allh ky qsm aap as myn dakhl nhyn hwn gay jb tk kh myn aysa nh kr lwn awr agr as myn kwyy chyz nh hw gy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya۔ phr wh dakhl hwa awr jharw dya awr as kay phlw myn kchh swrakh dykhay tw as nay apna nchla lbas phar kr as say rwk dya۔ lykn jb dw abhy baqy thay tw as nay apnay paon an myn dalay [*] awr khda kay rswl kw andr janay kw kha۔ jb wh aysa kr chkay tw nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay apna sr aap ky gwd myn rkha awr sw gyay۔ abwbkr kay paon myn say ayk swrakh myn dnk lga، lykn wh as dr say nhyn hlay kh khyn khda ka rswl bydar hw jayay۔ as kay aansw bhr hal khda kay rswl kay chhray pr gray awr as nay as say pwchha kh asay kya hwa؟ as nay jwab dya، 'aay wh js kay lyay myn apnay wald awr waldh kw fdyh kay twr pr dwn ga، mjhay dnday maray gyay hyn۔' khda kay rswl nay phr thwk dya awr drd nay asay chhwr dya، lykn zhr ka asr bad myn waps aaya awr as ky mwt ka sbb bna۔ wh dn tha jb khda kay rswl ky wfat hwyy awr arbwn nay mrtd hw kr zkw dynay say ankar kr dya۔ as nay kha، 'agr wh mjhay tychr dynay say ankar kr dyn tw myn as pr an kay sath jdwjhd krwn ga۔' myn nay arz kya، ''khda kay rswl kay janshyn، lwgwn kay sath mlnsar awr nrm mzaj hw''، lykn as nay jwab dya ''kya tm jw zmanh jahlyt myn taqtwr thay، aslamy dwr myn kmzwr hw gyay؟ why bnd hw gyy awr dyn kaml hw gya۔ kya yh km hwna hay jb tk myn zndh hwn؟'' razn nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6035","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm say phlay ky amtwn myn alham hwyay awr agr myry amt myn kwyy hay tw wh amr hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6036","sad b۔ abw wqas nay byan kya kh amr rzy allh anh alkhtab nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as wqt andr janay ky ajazt tlb ky jb an kay sath qrysh ky kchh awrtyn thyn jw aap sly allh alyh wslm say awnchy aawaz myn batyn kr rhy thyn۔ jb amr rzy allh anh nay ajazt chahy tw wh athay awr prdh krnay myn jldy ky، awr jb amr rzy allh anh andr dakhl hwyay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hns rhay thay، tw anhwn nay kha: allh aap kw mskrata rkhay، allh kay rswl! aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh myn an awrtwn kw dykh kr hyran rh gya jw myray sath hyn kywnkh jb anhwn nay aap ky aawaz sny tw prdh krnay myn jldy ky۔ amr rzy allh anh nay phr kha kh apnay dshmnwn kya tm mjh say drtay hw awr allh kay rswl say nhyn drtay؟ anhwn nay jwab dya، ''han، tm zyadh bdtmyz awr skht hw۔'' phr khda kay rswl nay kha ''kwyy bat nhyn abn alkhtab! qsm hay as zat ky js kay hath myn myry jan hay kh shytan aap say phary rastay pr chltay hwyay aap kay alawh ksy dwsray kay pas nhyn gya hw ga۔\ alhmydy nay kha kh \""khda kay rswl\"" kay bad albrqany nay mzyd kha kh ''tmhyn ks chyz say hnsy aaty hay[*]؟ *yany، amr kay as rymark kay bad، \""khda aap kw mskrata rkhay، khda kay rswl۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6037","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh myn jnt myn dakhl hwa awr abw tlhh ky bywy rwmysh say mla، ayk hrkt sn kr myn nay pwchha kh yh kwn hay awr btaya gya kh yh blal hyn، myn nay ayk mhl dykha js kay shn myn ayk lrky thy awr jb myn nay pwchha kh yh ks ka mhl hay tw mjhay btaya gya kh wh as myn dakhl hwna chahta tha، lykn myn nay amr rzy allh anh kw dykhna chaha۔ tmhary ghyrt mnd ftrt۔\ amr rzy allh anh nay jwab dya kh allh kay rswl jn kay lyay myn apnay wald awr waldh kw fdyh myn dwn ga، kya myn aap say hsd kr skta hwn؟ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6038","abwsayd rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb myn sw rha tha tw myn nay dykha kh lwg myray samnay qmyzyn phnay hwyay hyn، jn myn say kchh npl tk phnch gyay hyn awr kchh as tk nhyn phnch skay hyn، phr amr bn khtab rzy allh anh kw ayk qmys phnayy gyy js say wh pychhay chl rhay thay۔ an say pwchha gya kh aap nay as ky tshryh kysay ky awr jwab dya kh as ka mtlb mzhb hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6039","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh myn sw rha tha kh myray pas dwdh ka ayk pyalh laya gya awr pya gya yhan tk kh myn nay dykha kh myray nakhnwn say kya nshh nkl rha hay، phr myn nay jw bcha hwa tha wh amr bn khtab rzy allh anh kw day dya۔ as say pwchha gya kh as ky tshryh kysay ky tw jwab dya kh as say mrad alm hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6040","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna kh myn sw rha tha kh myn nay apnay aap kw ayk knwyn kay awpr dykha js pr ayk dwl tha، myn nay as say jw allh nay chaha nkala، phr abw qhafh kay bytay nay as myn say ayk ya dw dwl nkalay، lykn as kay nqsh myn kchh kmzwry thy js ky wjh say allh taalyٰ asay maaf kray، phr myn nay as knwyn kay knwyn kay awpr ayk dwl dala awr myn nay kabh ky pkr myn tbdyl kr dya۔ ayk mzbwt aadmy kw dykha jysa kh amr nay kya tha، yhan tk kh awnt kafy hw gyay awr lyt gyay[2]۔ [1] yany، abwbkr [2] ya، \lwgwn nay apny pyas bjhayy awr pany pr thhray rhay۔\"""""""
"6041","arby myn shrh nas bayn hay abn amr ky rwayt myn hay kh anhwn nay kha kh phr alkhtab kay bytay nay asay abwbkr kay hath say lay lya awr yh ayk bry dwl myn bdl gya، myn nay ksy mzbwt aadmy kw nhyn dykha kh as nay kya kya، yhan tk kh lwg kafy hw gyay awr awnt kafy hw gyay awr lyt gyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6042","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay amr rzy allh anh ky zban awr dl pr hq rkha hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6043","abwdaod ky rwayt myn abwzr say mrwy hay kh anhwn nay kha kh allh taalyٰ nay amr rzy allh anh ky zban pr hq rkha awr wh bwltay hyn۔ aly nay kha۔ hm nay yh nammkn nhyn smjha kh skynh amr ky zban say bat kray۔ byhqy nay asay dlayl alnbw myn nql kya hay۔"
"6044","aly rzy allh anh nay kha: hm as bat kw bayd nhyn smjhtay kh amr rzy allh anh ky zban say tsly dynay waly batyn nklyn۔ shyh، jsay byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"6045","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aay allh abwjhl bn hsham ya amr bn khtab rzy allh anh say aslam kw mzbwt kr۔ sbh hwtay hy amr rzy allh anh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay awr aslam qbwl kr lya۔ phr msjd myn khl kr nmaz ada ky۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6046","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb amr rzy allh anh nay abwbkr kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay bad sb say afzl aadmy kha tw abwbkr rzy allh anh nay jwab dya kh myn nay yh bat khy hay tw myn asay bta skta hwn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh amr rzy allh anh say bhtr aadmy pr swrj tlwa nhyn hwa۔"
"6047","aqbh b۔ aamr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: agr myray bad kwyy nby hwta tw wh amr bn khtab rzy allh anh hwtay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6048","brydh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apny ayk mhm pr nklay thay awr jb wh waps aayay tw ayk kaly lwndy aayy awr khnay lgy: aay allh kay rswl، myn nay nzr many hay kh agr allh aap kw shyh slamt waps lay aayay tw myn aap kay samnay df bjaon ga awr gaon ga۔‘‘ as nay jwab dya، ’’agr tm nay nzr many hay tw bjao۔ wrnh mt krw۔'' wh khylnay lgy awr abw bkr khyltay hwyay andr dakhl hwyay۔ phr aly rzy allh anh andr dakhl hwyay jb wh khyl rhy thyn۔ phr asman rzy allh anh andr dakhl hwyay jb wh khyl rhy thyn۔ phr amr rzy allh anh andr dakhl hwyay awr wh df apnay nychay dal kr as pr byth gyyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya amr tm say shytan drta hay، myn bytha hwa tha kh wh khyl rhy thy، phr abwbkr rzy allh anh as wqt dakhl hwyay jb wh khyl rhy thyn، phr aly rzy allh anh as wqt dakhl hwyay jb wh khyl rhy thyn، phr asman rzy allh anh as wqt dakhl hwyay jb wh khyl rhy thyn، lykn jb tm amr rzy allh anh kay andr dakhl hwyay tw as nay df kw nychay phynk dya۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6049","jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm byth gyay tw hm nay knfywzhn awr lrkwn ky aawazyn sny، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm athay awr dykha kh ayk hbshy awrt apnay ardgrd lrkwn kay sath nach rhy hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aayshh aayshh rzy allh anha aao awr dykhw tw myn nay ja kr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay kndhay pr thwry rkh dy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay kndhay pr an kw dykhnay lga۔ as nay phr mjh say kha، \kya tmharay pas kafy nhyn hay؟ kya tmharay pas kafy nhyn hay؟\"" awr myn khnay lga، \""nhyn\"" takh myn dykhwn kh myn as kay sath khan tha۔ lykn amr rzy allh anh aayay awr jb lwg an kay pas say bhagay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myn an shytanwn awr jnwn kw dykh rha hwn jw amr rzy allh anh say bhagay hyn۔ myn phr waps chla gya۔ *yany hbshy awrt۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6050","ans awr abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh amr rzy allh anh nay kha: myn nay apnay rb say tyn batwn pr atfaq kya۔ myn nay kha، \khda kay rswl، kash hm abrahym kay mqam kw nmaz ky jgh bna lytay!\"" awr why nazl hwyy، \""awr abrahym kay mqam kw nmaz ky jgh smjhw۔\"" myn nay kha، \""khda kay rswl، jhan aap ky awrtyn hwn whan prhyzgar awr bdkar dwnwn aatay hyn۔ kash aap anhyn alg rhnay ka hkm dytay۔\"" phr khlwt kay baray myn aayt atry۔ nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ky azwaj mthrat ayk hw gyyn awr myn nay kha kh shayd agr wh tmhyn tlaq day day tw as ka rb asay tmhary jgh tm say bhtr bywyan day ga۔ phr as asr pr ayk why nazl hwyy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6051","abn amr rzy allh anh ky rwayt myn hay kh amr rzy allh anh nay kha: myn nay apnay rb say tyn batwn pr atfaq kya، mqam abrahym، khlwt awr bdr kay qydywn kay baray myn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6052","abn msawd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh amr rzy allh anh kw char wjwhat ky bna pr ansanwn say afzl qrar dya gya: jng bdr kay qydywn kay zkr say۔ as nay hkm dya kh an kw qtl kr dya jayay awr khdayay bzrg w brtr nay yh hkm nazl kya kh agr khda ky trf say ayk hkm phlay nh aa chka hwta tw jw kchh tm nay lya as kay bdlay tm pr skht azab aata۔ as ky khlwt kay zkr say۔ as nay nby sly allh alyh wslm ky azwaj kw alg thlg rhnay ka hkm dya awr zynb rzy allh anha nay an say kha kh abn alkhtab jb hmaray ghrwn myn why nazl hwty hay tw kya aap kw hm pr mqrr kya gya hay؟ phr allh taalyٰ nay nazl frmaya: \awr jb tm an say kchh mangw tw prday kay pychhay say mangw۔\"" nby sly allh alyh wslm ky daa say، \""aay allh، amr kay zryaay aslam kw mzbwt kr۔\"" abwbkr kay baray myn an ky rayay say jn ky byat anhwn nay sb say phlay ky۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6053","aba sayd nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \wh shkhs jnt myn myry amt myn sb say aalyٰ drjh ka hwga۔\"" aba sayd nay kha: myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh aakhr amr tk hm yhy smjhtay rhay kh wh shkhs amr bn khtab kay alawh kwyy nhyn۔ alkhtab asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"6054","aslm nay kha: abn amr rzy allh anh nay mjh say an kay baray myn kchh pwchha، yany amr rzy allh anh kay baray myn، jb myn nay anhyn atlaa dy tw anhwn nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay aanay kay bad amr rzy allh anh say brh kr amr kay aakhr tk ksy kw nhyn dykha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6055","almswar b۔ mkhrmh nay kha: jb amr rzy allh anh kw war kya gya tw wh tklyf myn rhnay lgay، awr abn abas rzy allh anh jw asay tsly dynay ky kwshsh kr rhay thay، nay kha: as sb ky fkr nh krw، tm allh kay rswl kay achhay sathy thay awr jb wh tm say rkhst hwyay tw wh tm say razy thay، tm abwbkr kay achhay sathy thay awr jb anhwn nay tmhyn chhwr dya tw tm an kay sath khwsh hw gyay awr agr tm an kay sath khwsh hw gyay tw tm an kay sath khwsh hw gyay۔ tm aysa krw gay jb wh tm say razy hwn gay۔\ as nay jwab dya kh jhan tk tm nay allh kay rswl kay sath myry shbt awr an ky khwshnwdy ka zkr kya hay، wh tw srf allh ka ahsan tha jw as nay mjh pr kya tha، jysa kh tm nay abwbkr kay sath myry shbt awr an ky khwshnwdy ka zkr kya hay، wh tw mhz allh ky trf say ahsan tha jw as nay mjh pr kya tha، lykn as ka hsab tm pr hay awr myn tmhary zmh daryan smjhta hwn۔ khda ky qsm agr myray pas atna swna hay jtna zmyn bhr jayay ga tw myn khda kay azab say as kw dykhnay say phlay apnay aap kw fdyh myn day dwn ga۔ bkhary nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6056","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh ayk aadmy gayay kw chla rha tha، wh thk gya awr as ky pyth pr swar hw gya، tw as nay kha kh hm as kay lyay nhyn bnayay gyay hyn، blkh srf zmyn khyty kay lyay pyda kyay gyay hyn۔ lwgwn nay kha allh pak hay kya gayay bwl skty hay؟ awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh myn bhy as pr ayman lata hwn jysa kh abwbkr w amr rzy allh anhma bhy hyn lykn wh as wqt whan mwjwd nhyn thay، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay btaya kh ayk shkhs apny bkrywn kw chra rha tha kh ayk bhyryay nay an myn say ayk pr hmlh kr kay asay pkr lya، as kay malk nay asay pkr kr bcha lya awr bhyryay nay as say kha: ”as ky dykh bhal kwn kray ga، lykn jb wh dn aayay ga tw as ky dykh bhal kwn kray ga؟ myn؟\ lwgwn nay kha، \""khda ky qsm! kya bhyrya bwl skta hay؟\"" as nay jwab dya، \""myn bhy as pr ayman lata hwn jysa kh abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anhma bhy mantay hyn، lykn wh as wqt whan mwjwd nhyn thay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6057","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha: myn kchh lwgwn kay drmyan khra tha jw amr rzy allh anh kay lyay daa kr rhay thay jb wh apnay plng pr rkhay gyay thay، awr myray pychhay ayk aadmy js nay apny khny myray kndhay pr rkhy hwyy thy، khh rha tha: allh aap pr rhm kray، mjhay amyd hay kh allh aap kw aap kay dwnwn sathywn kay sath rkhay، kywnkh myn nay aksr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay sna tha kh myn nay abw bkr rzy allh anh awr abw bkr rzy allh anh kw yh khtay hwyay sna tha۔ amr nay kya... ''myn، abwbkr awr amr rwanh hwyay...'' ''myn، abwbkr awr amr dakhl hwyay...''، ''myn، abwbkr awr amr bahr nklay...'' abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh jb as nay mr kr dykha tw dykha kh yh aly rzy allh anh hyn۔ abw b۔ talb۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6058","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jnt walay awr ahlِ alyٰ ayk dwsray kw as trh dykhyn gay jysay tm aasman kay knarwn myn chmkta hwa starh dykhtay hw، awr abwbkr w amr rzy allh anhma an myn say hwn gay، jn pr khas ahsan kya gya hay۔ asay shrh alsn myn nql kya gya hay awr abwdaod، trmzy awr abn majh nay bhy asy asr kw nql kya hay۔"
"6059","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”abwbkr w amr jnt kay drmyany amr kay bashndwn kay srdar hwn gay، an lwgwn myn say jw abtdayy awr aakhry zmanay kay thay، swayay anbyaa awr rswlwn kay“۔"
"6060","asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay awr abn majh nay asay aly ky snd say rwayt kya hay۔"
"6061","hzyfh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn nhyn janta kh myn kb tk tmharay drmyan rhwn ga، lhza myray janay kay bad jw baqy rh jayyn gay، abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anh kw nql krw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6062","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm msjd myn dakhl hwyay tw abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anh kay alawh kwyy awr sr athata tha۔ wh as ky trf mskratay awr wh an say mskrata۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6063","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk dn bahr tshryf lay gyay awr abw bkr awr amr rzy allh anhma kay sath msjd myn dakhl hwyay، an myn say ayk an kay dayyn trf awr dwsra bayyn trf tha، an ka hath pkray hwyay tha۔ as nay kha kh hm qyamt kay dn asy trh athayay jayyn gay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6064","abdallh by hntb nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abwbkr w amr rzy allh anhma kw dykha awr frmaya kh yh snnay awr dykhnay walay hyn۔ trmzy nay asay mrsl ky swrt myn nql kya hay۔"
"6065","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky۔ \kwyy nby aysa nhyn hay js kay dw wzyr aasmanwn myn say awr dw ahl zmyn myn say nh hwn، aasman walwn myn say myray dw wzyr jbrayyl awr mykayyl hyn awr zmyn walwn myn say myray dw wzyr abwbkr w amr hyn۔\"" trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6066","abwbkrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk shkhs nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh myn nay dykha gwya aasman say ayk trazw atra، aap awr abwbkr rzy allh anh ka wzn tha، aap ka wzn abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anh say zyadh tha، awr abwbkr rzy allh anh ka wzn zyadh tha، awr amr rzy allh anh ka wzn tha awr amr rzy allh anh ka wzn zyadh tha، phr wh plra athaya gya tha۔ khda ka rswl as pr ghmgyn tha، yany jw kchh as shkhs nay asay btaya as nay asay ghmgyn kya۔ as nay phr kha kh nbwt kay nmwnay pr khlaft hwgy phr allh jsay chahay ga badshahy day ga۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6067","abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmharay pas wh shkhs aayay ga jw jntywn myn say hw ga۔ phr abwbkr rzy allh anh aayay۔ phr frmaya kh tmharay pas wh shkhs aayay ga jw jntywn myn say hw ga۔ phr amr rzy allh anh aayay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6068","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: chandny rat myn jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka sr myry gwd myn tha، myn nay pwchha، ya rswl allh، kya ksy nay atnay achhay kam kyay hyn jtnay aasman pr staray hyn؟ as nay jwab dya kh han amr rzy allh anh kay pas hay۔ myn nay pwchha kh abwbkr ky nykywn ka mwaznh kya hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh amr ky tmam nykyan abwbkr ky nykywn myn say ayk jysy hyn۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6069","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apnay ghr myn apny ran ya tangwn kay sath lytay hwyay thay، jb abwbkr rzy allh anh nay andr janay ky ajazt chahy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ajazt day dy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay gftgw ky۔ amr rzy allh anh nay andr janay ky ajazt chahy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ajazt day dy jb kh wh aysay hy thay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay gftgw ky۔ phr hzrt asman rzy allh anh nay andr janay ky ajazt chahy awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ath kr byth gyay awr apna lbas trtyb dya۔ jb wh bahr nklay tw aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh abwbkr rzy allh anh dakhl hwyay tw aap nay an kay lyay kwyy hlchl nhyn ky awr nh an ky fkr ky، phr amr rzy allh anh dakhl hwyay، aap nay an kay lyay nh hlaya awr nh hy an ky fkr ky، phr asman rzy allh anh dakhl hwyay awr aap nay byth kr apna lbas trtyb dya۔ as nay jwab dya kh kya myn as kay sath nrmy nh krwn js kay sath frshtay nrmy krtay hyn؟ ayk rwayt myn as nay kha، \asman ayk mamwly aadmy hyn، awr mjhay dr tha kh agr myn nay as kw as halt myn dakhl hwnay dya tw shayd wh mjhay nh btayay kh wh kya chahtay hyn۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6070","tlhh b۔ abydallh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh hr nby ka ayk sathy hwta hay awr myra sathy (yany jnt myn) asman hwga۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6071","abn majh nay asay abwhryrh say rwayt kya hay۔ trmzy nay kha kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay js ky snd mzbwt nhyn hay awr twt gyy hay۔"
"6072","abdalrhmn by۔ khtab nay kha: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath tha jb aap sly allh alyh wslm lwgwn kw msybt zdh fwj ky mdd krnay ky tlqyn kr rhay thay۔ hzrt asman athay awr arz kya kh ya rswl allh myn sw awntwn kw an kay kprwn awr zynwn kay sath rah khda myn frahm krwn ga۔ as kay bad aap sly allh alyh wslm nay fwj ky mdd ky drkhwast ky tw hzrt asman rzy allh anh nay khray hw kr kha kh myn dw sw awntwn kw an kay kpray awr zynwn kay sath rah khda myn frahm krwn ga۔ as nay phr takyd ky awr asman athay awr kha kh myn tyn sw awntwn kw an kay kpray awr zynwn kay sath rah khda myn frahm krwn ga۔ myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw mnbr say atrtay hwyay dykha awr aap frma rhay thay kh as kay bad jw kchh wh kray ga wh asman rzy allh anh kay khlaf shmar nh hw ga، as kay bad jw kchh wh kray ga wh asman rzy allh anh pr shmar nhyn hw ga۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6073","abdalrhmn by۔ smrh nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay msybt zdh fwj kw tyar kya tw asman rzy allh anh an kay lyay ayk hzar dynar apny aastyn myn lay kr aayay awr anhyn apny gwd myn bkhyr dya۔ awr myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha kh wh anhyn apny gwd myn lay rhay hyn awr dw bar khh rhay hyn: \asman aaj kay bad jw kchh kryn gay as say wh zkhmy nhyn hwn gay۔\"" ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6074","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay allh ky khwshnwdy kay lyay byat ka hkm dya tw asman rzy allh anh allh kay rswl ky hysyt say mkh gyay thay۔ phr jb lwgwn nay byat kr ly tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ''asman allh kay karwbar awr as kay rswl kay karwbar myn msrwf hyn۔ as kay bad as nay apna ayk hath dwsray pr mara awr rswl allh ka hath asman ky trf say lwgwn kay hathwn say bhtr tha۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6075","thwma by۔ hzn alqshyry khtay hyn kh myn ghr myn mwjwd tha kh asman rzy allh anh nay lwgwn pr nzr daly awr kha kh myn tmhyn khda awr aslam ky qsm dyta hwn، kya tm jantay hw kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mdynh tshryf layay awr as myn kwyy tazh pany nhyn tha mgr bayr rwmh tha، as ky khwahsh thy kh wh awr mslman as myn apny baltyan dbw dyn، myn nay pwchha kh as say bhtr kwn khryday ga؟ phr bhy tm mjhay as kay pynay say rwk rhay hw takh mjhay khara pany pyna pray۔ jb anhwn nay khda ky qsm khayy kh wh bakhbr hyn tw aap nay frmaya kh myn tmhyn khda awr aslam ky qsm dyta hwn، kya tm jantay hw kh jb msjd lwgwn kay lyay bht chhwty hw gyy tw rswl khda nay pwchha kh flan kay khandan ka plat jnt myn bhtr kay lyay kwn khryday ga awr asay msjd myn shaml kray ga awr myn nay asay apnay srmayay say khryda hay، phr bhy tm mjhay dw rkat nmaz prhnay say rwk rhay hw؟ jb anhwn nay khda ky qsm khayy kh wh bakhbr hyn tw aap nay frmaya: myn tmhyn khda awr aslam ky qsm dyta hwn، kya tm jantay hw kh myn nay apnay mal say msybt kay lshkr kw lys kya؟ jb anhwn nay khda ky qsm khayy kh wh bakhbr hyn tw aap nay frmaya: myn tmhyn khda awr aslam ky qsm dyta hwn، kya tm jantay hw kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mkh myn sbyr pr thay jn kay sath abd bkr، amr awr myn thay، phar aysa lrz atha kh as kay pthr ykay bad dygray nychay zmyn pr gr rhay thay، tw as nay asay apnay paon say lat mary، awr srf ayk dwst nay kha، srf sbyr whyn hyn، srf ayk dwst nay kha۔ awr tm pr dw shhyd؟\ jb anhwn nay khda ky qsm khayy kh wh bakhbr hyn tw aap nay tyn bar frmaya kh khda sb say bra hay، anhwn nay kabh kay rb ky trf say gwahy dy hay kh myn shhyd hwn۔ asay trmzy، nsayy awr darqtny nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6076","mrra by kab nay kha: myn nay khda kay rswl kw sna jb aap nay khanh jngywn awr an kay qryb hwnay ka zkr kya۔ awr jb ayk aadmy js kay pas say chadr awrhay hwyay thay gzray tw frmaya kh as dn yh shkhs hdayt pa jayay ga۔ myn atha awr as kay pas gya tw dykha kh wh asman bn thay۔ afan nay phr as kw nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ky trf kr kay pwchha kh kya yh wh aadmy hay tw as nay jwab dya han۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"6077","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”shayd allh tmhyn ayk qmys phnayay، asman rzy allh anh، awr agr lwg chahyn kh tm asay atar dw tw an kay lyay asay nh atarw“۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay nql kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh rwayt ayk twyl dastan pr mshtml hay۔"
"6078","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk swl hngamh ka zkr kya awr asman rzy allh anh kay baray myn frmaya kh yh as myn nahq mara jayay ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn rwayt hay js ky snd ghryb hay۔"
"6079","abw shlh nay byan kya kh asman rzy allh anh nay ghr kay dn an say kha kh allh kay rswl nay mjh say ahd kya hay awr myn as pr qaym rhnay myn sbr krwn ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"6080","asman b۔ abdallh by mhb nay btaya kh ayk shkhs js ka talq msr say tha hj ky nyt say aaya awr as nay dykha kh kchh lwg bythay hyn۔ as nay pwchha kh yh kwn lwg hyn tw btaya gya kh yh qrysh hyn۔ as nay pwchha kh an myn say shykh kwn hay awr jb asay btaya gya kh wh abdallh bn hyn۔ amr rzy allh anh nay kha kh abn amr، mjhay aap say ayk swal krna hay، tw mjhay btayyay، kya aap jantay hyn kh asman rzy allh anh jng ahd myn bhag gyay thay؟ as nay jwab dya kh han۔ as nay pwchha kya tm jantay hw kh wh bdr say ghayb tha awr whan mwjwd nh hw ska؟ as nay jwab dya kh han۔ as nay pwchha kya tm jantay hw kh wh khda ky khwshnwdy ky byat say ghayb tha awr whan hazr hwnay myn nakam rha؟ as nay jwab dya kh han۔ as aadmy nay kha: allh sb say bra hay، awr abn amr nay kha: aao myn tmhyn kchh smjhata hwn، jhan tk ahd ky jng myn as kay bhagnay ka talq hay، myn gwahy dyta hwn kh allh nay asay maaf kr dya، bdr myn as ky ghyr mwjwdgy ky wjh say as ky shady rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky byty rqyh say hwyy jw bymar thy، awr asay btaya gya kh allh kay bnday nay jw mjhay pysh kya tha awr wh as ky khdmt myn hazr hwa tha۔ ghzwh bdr myn awr allh ky rza ky byat say an ky adm mwjwdgy ka talq hay kh agr mkh ky wady myn asman rzy allh anh say zyadh kwyy mazz hwta tw wh asay bhyj dyta، lykn allh kay rswl nay asman rzy allh anh kw bhyj dya awr allh ky khwshnwdy ky byat hzrt asman rzy allh anh kay hath say janay kay bad hwyy۔ yh asman ka hath hay awr aap nay apnay dwnwn hath aaps myn maray awr kha kh yh asman kay lyay hay۔ abn amr rzy allh anh nay kha kh ab chlay jao awr asay apnay pas rkhw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"6081","abw shlh asman rzy allh anh kay mokl khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asman rzy allh anh say khlwt myn kchh khna shrwa kya tw asman rzy allh anh ka rng bdl gya۔ ghr walay dn، hm nay as say pwchha kh kya wh jng nhyn kray ga tw as nay jwab dya، \nhyn، khda kay rswl nay mjh pr kchh alzam lgaya hay awr myn as pr qaym rhnay myn sbr ka mzahrh krwn ga۔\"""""""
"6082","abw hbybh nay byan kya kh wh as wqt ghr myn dakhl hwyay jb asman rzy allh anh as myn mhswr thay awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh kw asman rzy allh anh say bat krnay ky ajazt mangtay hwyay sna۔ as nay asay ajazt day dy، tw wh atha، khda ky hmd w sna byan ky، phr byan kya kh myn nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay sna hay، \myray janay kay bad tm myn khanh jngy awr akhtlaf hw ga (ya as nay kha، akhtlaf awr khanh jngy)۔\"" lwgwn myn say ayk nay as say pwchha kh aay khda kay rswl hm ks ky ataat kryn؟ ya، \""aap hmyn kya hkm dytay hyn؟\"" aap nay jwab dya، \""kmandr awr as kay sathywn ky pabndy krw،\"" asy wqt asman ky trf asharh krtay hwyay byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn dwnwn rwayat nql ky hyn۔"""""
"6083","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm، abwbkr، amr awr asman rzy allh anhm ahd pr gyay awr jb an ky wjh say wh lrzta tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay apnay paon say lat mary awr frmaya: ahd sabt qdm rhw، kywnkh tjh pr srf ayk nby، ayk dwst awr dw shhyd hyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6084","abwmwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn mdynh kay baghwn myn say ayk bagh myn nby sly allh alyh wslm kay sath tha awr ayk aadmy drwazh khwlnay ka mtalbh kr rha tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as kay lyay khwl dw awr asay jnt ky bshart dw۔ myn nay as kay lyay drwazh khwla tw dykha kh wh abwbkr hyn، awr jb myn nay asay allh kay rswl ky khwshkhbry snayy tw as nay allh ky hmd ky۔ ayk awr aadmy aaya awr drwazh khwlnay ky drkhwast ky tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh asay khwl dw awr asay jnt ky bshart dw۔ myn nay as kay lyay drwazh khwla tw dykha kh wh amr rzy allh anh hyn awr jb myn nay an kw btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay allh ky hmd ky۔ ayk awr aadmy nay drwazh khwlnay ky drkhwast ky tw as nay kha kh asay khwl dw awr asay ayk aazmaysh kay bad jnt ky bshart dw jw an kw tklyf day gy۔ myn nay paya kh wh asman hyn، awr jb myn nay anhyn btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kya kha tha، tw anhwn nay allh ky hmd w sna ky awr phr kha: allh hy wh hay js say mdd mangy jaty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6085","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm zndh thay tw hm khtay thay kh abwbkr، amr awr asman rzy allh anh! asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6086","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”gzshth rat ayk nyk aadmy nay khwab dykha js myn abwbkr rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say، amr rzy allh anh abwbkr rzy allh anh say awr asman rzy allh anh nay amr rzy allh anh kay sath ml gyay thay۔ jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb hm athay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rkhst hwyay tw hm nay kha kh nyk aadmy allh kay rswl hyn awr an kay aaps myn mlnay ka mtlb yh hay kh wh as maamlay kay hakm hyn js kay sath allh nay apnay nby kw bhyja tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"6087","sad b۔ abw wqas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aly rzy allh anh say frmaya kh tm mjh say why nsbt rkhtay hw jw harwn alyh alslam ky mwsyٰ say thy، lykn myray bad kwyy nby nhyn aayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6088","zrr b۔ hbysh nay byan kya kh aly rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn as zat ky qsm khata hwn js nay danh kw tqsym kya awr rwh kw pyda kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay yqyn dlaya kh mjh say srf mwmn hy mhbt kray ga awr srf mnafq hy mjh say nfrt kray ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6089","shl by۔ sad nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khybr kay dn frmaya kh myn kl yh mayar zrwr as shkhs kw dwn ga jw khda awr as kay rswl say mhbt krta hay awr khda awr as kay rswl say mhbt krta hay js kay hath pr khda fth kray ga۔ sbh hwtay hy lwg rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas as amyd pr aatay thay kh aap kw yh dya jayay ga، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha: aly bn abw talb khan hyn؟ yh malwm hwnay pr kh wh aankh ky tklyf myn mbtla hay، as nay an say kha kh asay blwayyn، awr jb asay laya gya tw khda kay rswl nay as ky aankhwn myn thwk dya awr wh sht yab hw gyay، aysa lga kh gwya as kay sath kwyy ghlty nhyn hwyy hay۔ phr as nay asay mayar dya، awr as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myn an say as wqt tk lrwn ga jb tk kh wh hmary trh nh hwjayyn۔\"" phr frmaya kh nrmy say chlw yhan tk kh tm an kay mzafat myn phnchw، phr anhyn aslam qbwl krnay ky dawt dw awr khda kay an mtalbat say aagah krw jw as myn an kay lyay hwn gay، khda ky qsm tmharay lyay yh bhtr hwga kh khda apnay adaray kay zryah ayk aadmy kw hdayt day as say kh tm awntwn kay drmyan srkh kw hasl krw۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) albraa ky rwayt js myn anhwn nay aly say kha، \""tm mjh say talq rkhtay hw awr myn tm say talq rkhta hwn\"" bab myn nwjwanwn kay blwght ka zkr kya gya hay۔"""""
"6090","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay frmaya: \aly mjh say talq rkhtay hyn awr myn an say talq rkhta hwn، awr wh hr mwmn kay wly hyn۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6091","zyd by۔ arqm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh jb myn ksy ka wly hwn tw aly bhy as ka srprst hwta hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6092","hbshy by۔ jnadh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay kha: \aly mjh say talq rkhtay hyn awr myn aly say talq rkhta hwn، awr kwyy bhy myry trf say kwyy ntyjh akhz nhyn kray ga swayay myray ya aly kay۔\"" asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay awr ahmd nay abwjnadh say rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"6093","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay shabh kay drmyan bhayy charay ka antzam kya tw aly rzy allh anh rwtay hwyay aayay awr kha: tm nay apnay sathywn kay drmyan bhayy charay ka antzam kr lya، lykn tm nay myray awr ksy kay drmyan bhayy charh nhyn rkha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm dnya awr aakhrt myn myray bhayy hw۔"
"6094","hzrt ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk prndh tha awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aay allh mjhay apny mkhlwq kw lao jw tjhay sb say zyadh mhbwb hay kh as prnday kw myray sath kha lay۔ phr aly aayay awr an kay sath khana khaya۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6095","aly rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kwyy chyz mangy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay dy awr jb myn nay kchh nh kha tw sb say phlay aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6096","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khbr dy kh myn hkmt ka ghr hwn awr aly as ka drwazh hay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay awr baz nay as rwayt kw sharq ky snd say nql kya hay as ka zkr kyay bghyr kh yh snabyl ky snd say mrwy hay۔ anhwn nay kha kh wahd matbr atharty js say wh as rwayt kw jantay thay wh sharq thay۔"
"6097","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh js dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aly rzy allh anh kw tayf bhyja tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn blaya awr an say khlwt myn bat ky۔ lwgwn nay kha، \as nay apnay kzn kay sath twyl gftgw ky hay،\"" awr khda kay rswl nay jwab dya، \""myn nay nhyn blkh khda nay as kay sath njy gftgw ky thy۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6098","abwsayd byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aly rzy allh anh say frmaya kh aly rzy allh anh as msjd myn tmharay ya myray alawh ksy awr kay lyay jayz nhyn hay۔ aly by almnzr nay btaya kh dyrar say pwchha jayay ۔ swrd nay as rwayt ka kya mtlb tha، awr as nay jwab dya kh as ka mtlb yh tha kh \tm ya myray alawh ksy awr kay lyay jayz nhyn kh wh rsmy njast ky halt myn as say gzray\""۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6099","am atyh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk lshkr kw rwanh kya js myn aly rzy allh anh thay awr anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apnay bazwon kw blnd krtay hwyay sna kh aay allh، mjhay as say phlay kh tw mjhay aly rzy allh anh kw dykhnay nh day۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6100","am slmh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mnafq aly say mhbt nhyn krta awr mwmn an say bghz nhyn rkhta۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay nql kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn rwayt hay js ky snd ghryb hay۔"
"6101","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \js nay aly kw galy dy as nay mjhay galy dy۔\"" ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6102","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya kh tm aysyٰ alyh alslam say mshabht rkhtay hw js say yhwdy as qdr nfrt krtay thay kh an ky waldh pr bhtan lgatay thay awr aysayy as say as qdr mhbt krtay thay kh anhyn as mqam pr fayz kr dya tha jw an kay nhyn thay۔ as kay bad aly nay frmaya: dw lwg myry wjh say hlak hw jayyn gay، ayk wh jw mjh say as qdr mhbt krta hay kh wh as chyz pr myry taryf krta hay jw myray pas nhyn hay، awr ayk wh jw mjh say as qdr nfrt krta hay kh as ky adawt mjh pr tan krnay pr mjbwr hw jaty hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6103","albraa bn aazb awr zyd bn۔ arqm nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm khm kay talab pr atray tw aap nay aly rzy allh anh ka hath pkr kr whan mwjwd lwgwn say pwchha: kya tm nhyn jantay kh myn mwmnyn kay an say zyadh qryb hwn؟ phr pwchha kya tm nhyn jantay kh myn hr mwmn say as ky zat say zyadh qryb hwn؟ awr anhwn nay jwab dya، \zrwr۔\"" as kay bad as nay kha: \""khdaya، js ka myn wly hwn، as ka aly as ka srprst hay۔ 0 khda، as kay sath dwsty rkh awr jw as kay dshmn hyn an say dshmny kr۔\"" as kay bad amr rzy allh anh nay an say mlaqat ky awr kha kh mbark hw byta abw talb، sbh w sham tw hr mwmn mrd w awrt ka srprst hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6104","brydh nay byan kya kh abwbkr awr amr nay nkah myn fatmh ka hath manga، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: wh jwan hay۔ phr aly rzy allh anh nay as say shady ka hath manga awr as ka nkah an say kr dya۔ n aasy nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6105","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tmam drwazay bnd krnay ka hkm dya swayay aly rzy allh anh kay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6106","aly nay kha: mjhay khda kay rswl kay slslay myn wh mqam hasl tha jw ksy awr mkhlwq myn nhyn tha۔ myn dn kay wqfay pr as kay pas aata awr khta، \alslam alykm aay khda kay nby\""۔ as nay phr gla saf kya tw myn apnay ghr walwn kay pas chla gya wrnh myn dakhl hw gya۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6107","as nay kha: khda ka rswl mjh pr as wqt aaya jb mjhay shkayt thy awr khh rhay thay kh aay khda agr myra mqrrh wqt aa gya hay tw mjhay aaram day، agr takhyr hw tw mjhay rzq ky frawany ata frma awr agr yh aazmaysh hay tw mjhay sbr ata kr۔ khda kay rswl nay as say pwchha kh as nay apnay aap kw kysay zahr kya hay، awr jb as nay apny bat dhrayy tw as nay asay ayk lat mary awr kha: \aay khda asay shfa day\"" ya \""as kw shfa day\"" transmytr kw shyh alfaz pr shk tha، as nay kha kh as nay bad myn drd ky shkayt nhyn ky، asay trmzy nay nql kya، kha kh yh hsn shyh rwayt hay۔"""""
"6108","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh an lwgwn say zyadh khlaft kay layq kwyy nhyn tha jn say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apny wfat kay wqt khwsh hwyay awr aap nay aly، asman، zbyr، tlhh، sad awr abdalrhmn ka nam lya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6109","qys b۔ abwhazm nay byan kya kh anhwn nay tlhh ka wh hath dykha js say anhwn nay jng ahd myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky hfazt ky thy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6110","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jngjwon ky lrayy myn frmaya: ''mjhay lwgwn ky khbr kwn layay ga؟'' jb zbyr nay kha، ''myn krwn ga''، tw aap nay frmaya: ''hr nby ka ayk mkhls dwst hwta hay awr myra zbyr hay۔'' (bkhary w mslm)"
"6111","zbyr rzy allh anh nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha: ''bqryzh kay pas kwn jayay ga awr mjhay an ky khbr layay ga؟'' myn gya، awr jb myn waps aaya tw as nay myray lyay apnay waldyn ka nam lay kr kha: ''myray wald awr myry waldh tmhara fdyh hwn''۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6112","aly rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apnay waldyn ka nam ayk sath rkhtay hwyay sna hay swayay sad kay۔ malk، kywnkh as nay jng ahd kay mwqa pr asay yh khtay hwyay sna tha kh ’’sad kw gwly marw، myray bap awr myry man ka fdyh hw‘‘ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6113","sad b۔ abw wqas nay kha kh wh phla arb tha js nay rah khda myn tyr mara۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6114","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mdynh mnwrh phnchay tw ayk rat bydar hwyay awr frmaya: kash kwyy nyk aadmy myry hfazt krta! phr hm nay hthyarwn ky aawaz sny، jb as nay pwchha kh whan kwn hay، sad nay jwab dya kh yh why hay۔ as nay pwchha kh as kay pas kya laya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh mjhay khda kay rswl ka khwf hwa tw myn as ky hfazt kay lyay hazr hwa، as pr drwd prh kr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sw gyay (bkhary w mslm)"
"6115","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr qwm ka ayk aymandar aadmy hwta hay، awr as qwm ka wfadar abw abydh bn aljrah hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6116","abn abw mlykh nay byan kya kh jb aayshh rzy allh anha say pwchha gya kh agr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ksy kw janshyn mqrr krtay tw anhwn nay anhyn yh khtay sna kh yh abwbkr rzy allh anh hwtay۔ an say pwchha gya kh abwbkr kay bad kwn hwta tw jwab dya kh yh amr hwtay۔ an say pwchha gya kh amr rzy allh anh kay bad kwn hwta tw jwab dya kh yh abw abydh rzy allh anh hwtay۔ aljrah mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6117","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm، abwbkr، amr، asman، aly، tlhh awr zbyr rzy allh anhm hyrh pr thay tw chtan lrz athy awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm khamwsh rhw، kywnkh tm pr kwyy nby ya kwyy dwst ya shhyd hay۔ abw wqas awr aly ka zkr nhyn kya۔ mslm nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"6118","abd alrhmn by۔ awf rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: abwbkr jnt myn jayyn gay، amr jnt myn jayyn gay، asman jnt myn jayyn gay، aly jnt myn jayyn gay، tlhh jnt myn jayyn gay، zbyr jnt myn jayyn gay، abdalrhmn an bn awf jnt myn jayyn gay، awf jnt myn jayyn gay۔ sayd bn zyd jnt myn jayyn gay awr abw abydh bn jrah jnt myn jayyn gay۔"
"6119","abn majh nay asay sayd say rwayt kya hay۔ zyd۔"
"6120","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt myn sb say zyadh rhm krnay walay abwbkr hyn، allh kay maamlay myn sb say zyadh skhty krnay walay amr rzy allh anh hyn، sb say zyadh hlym krnay walay asman hyn، frz kay baray myn sb say zyadh jannay walay zyd bn sabt hyn، jw sb say zyadh tlawt krna jantay hyn، qraan krym ka sb say zyadh alm rkhnay wala awr shryat ka alm rkhnay wala hay۔ awr jw chyz mmnwa hay wh hay maaz bn jbl ka ayk sqh wly hay awr as kw abw abydh bn jrah nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay، yh mrsl ky snd say bhy mrwy hay۔ qanwny maamlat myn sb say zyadh sykhnay wala aly hay۔"
"6121","zbyr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jng ahd myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay dw zrhyn phn rkhy thyn۔ wh chtan pr janay kay lyay ath khra hwa lykn awpr nh chrh ska، as lyay tlhh nay asay apny pyth pr qdm rkhnay dya awr as trh wh khwd kw chtan pr jma lya۔ myn nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh \tlhh nay apnay lyay jnt kw yqyny bna lya hay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6122","jabr nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tlhh bn ky trf dykha۔ abydallh nay kha kh agr kwyy ksy shkhs kw dykhay jw rwyay zmyn pr chl rha hw jb wh mr gya hw tw as aadmy kw dykh lay۔ ayk rwayt myn hay kh \agr kwyy rwyay zmyn pr chltay hwyay shhyd kw dykh kr khwshy mhsws kray tw wh tlhh bn abydallh kw dykh lay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6123","aly nay kha kh as kay kan nay rswl allh kay mnh say yh jmlh sna hay kh \tlhh awr zbyr jnt myn myray prwsy hwn gay۔\"" trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6124","sad b۔ abw wqas rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as dn yany ahd kay dn frmaya: aay allh as ky gwly kw mzbwt kr awr as ky daa ka jwab day۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"6125","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya: \aay khda، sad jb tjh say daa kray tw asay jwab dyna۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6126","aly nay kha kh sad wahd shkhs tha js kay lyay khda kay rswl nay an kay waldyn ka nam ayk sath rkha tha۔ jng ahd kay mwqa pr as nay as say kha، gwly marw، myray bap awr myry man tmhara fdyh hw! as nay as say yh bhy kha kh gwly marw mzbwt jwan۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6127","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh sad rzy allh anh aagay aayay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh myray mamwn hyn، ab kwyy shkhs mjhay apnay mamwn kw dkhayay۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay byan kya hay kh sad ka talq by zhrh say tha، js qbylay say rswl allh ky waldh ka talq tha، awr asy bna pr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh yh myray mamwn hyn۔ almsabyh nay \asay mjhay dkhanay dw\"" kay bjayay \""asay azt dw\"" kha hay۔"""""
"6128","qys b۔ abw hazm nay byan kya kh anhwn nay sad bn aly rzy allh anh kw sna۔ aba wqas khtay hyn kh myn arbwn myn phla aadmy tha js nay rah khda myn tyr mara، myn nay ayk mrtbh dykha jb hm rswl allh kay sath sfr pr thay awr hmaray pas mymwsay kay phl awr ptwn kay swa kchh khana nhyn tha kh hmara pakhanh khshk awr bhyr ky trh chhwtay chhwtay tkrwn myn pra hwa tha، by asad mjhay aslam kay baray myn nafrmany kay maamlay myn mlamt kr rhay thay۔ khsaray myn rhw awr jw kchh myn nay kya tha as kay fayday say mhrwm rhw۔\ anhwn nay amr rzy allh anh kw an kay khlaf atlaa dy thy kh anhwn nay nmaz shyh tryqay say ada nhyn ky۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6129","sad nay kha: myn nay khwd kw dykha hay۔ aslam ka tysra rkn، ksy nay asay qbwl nhyn kya swayay as dn kay js dn myn nay kya awr sat dnwn ky mdt myn myn nay aslam ka ayk thayy hsh bna lya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6130","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apny azwaj mthrat say frmaya krtay thay kh mjhay as bat ky fkr hay kh myray chlay janay kay bad tmhara kya bnay ga، jb srf aysar krnay walay awr schay fyaz lwg hy tmhary dykh bhal krtay rhyn gay۔ aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh as kay many sdqh dynay walay hyn۔ phr aayshh rzy allh anha nay abw slmh rzy allh anh say kha۔ abdalrhmn، \khda tmharay wald kw jnt myn slsbyl say pany playay!\"" abn awf nay mwmnyn ky maon kay lyay ayk bagh sdqh kya tha jw chalys hzar myn frwkht hwa tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6131","am slmh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apny azwaj mthrat say yh khtay hwyay sna: \myray janay kay bad jw tmharay sath hsn slwk kray wh mkhls awr mhrban hay، aay allh، abdalrhmn bn awf kw jnt myn slsbyl say pany plao۔\"" ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6132","hzyfh nay byan kya kh njran kay lwg rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha kh aay allh kay rswl hmaray pas ayk amant dar aadmy bhyjyn۔ jb as nay jwab dya، \myn aap kay pas ayk qabl aatmad aadmy zrwr bhyjwn ga jw hqyqy twr pr qabl aatmad hw،\"" lwg as bat ky trf mtwjh thay kh aaya an ka tqrr kya jayay ga۔ phr as nay abw abydh kw bhyja ۔ aljrah (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6133","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh aap kay janay kay bad aap ks kw kmandr bnayyn gay tw aap nay jwab dya kh agr aap abwbkr kw kmandr mqrr kryn gay tw aap anhyn amant dar payyn gay، dnya kay saman ky bht km khwahsh awr aakhrt kay shwqyn hwn gay، agr aap amr rzy allh anh kw kmandr mqrr kryn gay tw aap anhyn amant dar awr mzbwt payyn gay، agr aap kw khda ka khwf nh hw tw aap an kw amant dar payyn gay۔ ''aly kw kmandr kay twr pr، lykn myn tmhyn aysa krtay hwyay nhyn dykh skta، tm asay ayk rahnma pao gay jw hdayt yafth hw jw tmhyn sydhay rastay pr lay aayay۔'' ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6134","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''Allah Abu-Bakar par rehem farmaai , unhoney apni beti se meri shaadi ki, daare-hijrat ki taraf mujhey utha kar (apney oont par Sawar karkey) ley gaey, ghaar mein merey sath rahey, aur apney maal se Bilal ko azad karaya. aur umr par rehem farmaai , wo haq farmatey hain chahey (chhahe) wo kadwa ho, haq goi ne unhen tanha chhod diya isliye unka koi dost nahin, Allah Usman par rehem farmaai , farishtey bhi un se haya kartey hain, Allah Ali par rehem farmaai , aey Allah ! wo jahan bhi jaeyn haq unke sath hi rahey.'' Tirmizi, aur unhoney farmaya : ye hadees gharib hai. rawahu Tirmizi."
"6135","sad b۔ abw wqas rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb yh aayt atry kh \aao hm apnay bytwn awr aap kay bytwn kw blayyn...\"" allh kay rswl nay aly، fatmh، hsn awr hsyn kw blaya awr kha: \""aay allh، yh myray khandan kay afrad hyn۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6136","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ayk sbh bkry kay balwn waly dhary dar chadr phnay nklay۔ alhsn by۔ aly tshryf layay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn as kay nychay lay lya، phr hsyn alyh alslam aayay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sath as kay nychay chlay gyay، phr fatmh rzy allh anh aayyn awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn as kay nychay lay lya، phr aly rzy allh anh aayay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn as kay nychay lay lya۔ as kay bad aap nay frmaya: \khda srf yh chahta hay kh tm say، ahl khanh say nfrt kw dwr kray awr tmhyn pak kray۔\"" mslm nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6137","albraa nay byan kya kh jb abrahym ky wfat hwyy tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jnt myn as ky dwdh planay waly man hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6138","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: hm nby sly allh alyh wslm ky azwaj mthrat ayk mrtbh aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thyn jb fatmh rzy allh anha aayyn، an kay chlnay ka andaz rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say alg tha۔ asay dykh kr as nay kha، \khwsh aamdyd، myry byty\"" awr asay btha dya۔ phr as nay as say razdary myn kchh kha awr wh phwt phwt kr rw pry، tw jb as nay as ka ghm dykha tw as say razdary myn kchh awr kha awr wh hnsnay lgy۔ jb khda ka rswl ath kr chla gya tw myn nay as say pwchha kh aap nay as say razdary myn kya kha tha، lykn as nay jwab dya kh myn khda kay rswl kay razwn kw zahr krnay wala nhyn hwn۔ an ky wfat kay bad myn nay kha kh myn aap kw btanay kay lyay apnay hq ky qsm dyty hwn، awr as nay jwab dya، \""ab myn razy hwn، jb as nay mjh say phly bat ky tw as nay mjhay btaya kh jbrayyl kw sal myn ayk bar qraan prhnay ky aadt thy lykn wh as sal dw bar prh chkay thay، as lyay as nay mhsws kya kh as ka mqrrh wqt qryb aa gya hay، as kay bad as nay mjh say kha kh myn khda say drnay awr khtm krnay kay lyay ayk nyk nyty ka mzahrh krwn۔ myry pryshany dykh kr wh rwyay awr dwsry bar mjh say razdary myn bat ky kh kya tm as bat pr razy nhyn hw kh tm ahl jnt (ya mwmnyn ky awrtwn ky) srdar hw gy؟ ayk wrzhn hay، \""as nay mjh say njy twr pr bat ky awr mjhay btaya kh wh apnay drd say mr jayay ga، tw myn rw pra۔ phr as nay mjh say njy twr pr bat ky awr mjhay btaya kh myn as kay khandan ka phla frd hwn ga jw as ky pyrwy kray ga، tw myn hns pra۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6139","almswar b۔ mkhrmh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh fatmh myra ayk tkra hay as lyay js nay asay naraz kya as nay mjhay naraz kya۔ ayk wrzhn hay \jw chyz asay pryshan krty hay wh mjhay pryshan krty hay awr jw chyz asay tklyf dyty hay wh mjhay zkhmy krty hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6140","zyd by۔ arqm nay byan kya kh ayk dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm an kay drmyan mkh awr mdynh kay drmyan khm namy mqam pr an say khtab kay lyay athay۔ as nay khda ky hmd w snaa ky، ayk tnbyh awr nsyht ky awr phr kha kh aagay brhnay kay lyay: tm lwgwn kw smjh lyna chahyay kh myn srf ayk ansan hwn، myray rb ka rswl anqryb aayay ga awr myn as ky dawt ka jwab dwn ga، lykn myn tmharay drmyan dw ahm chyzyn chhwray ja rha hwn، phly ktab khda ky hay js myn hdayt awr rwshny hay، lhza as ka mtalah krw awr as pr aml krw۔ phr jb as nay khda ky ktab ky trf twjh dlayy awr as ky taryf ky tw as nay kha، \myray khandan kw bhy۔ myn tmhyn khda ky trf say apnay khandan ky dykh bhal krnay ka tmhara frz yad dlata hwn؛ myn tmhyn khda ky trf tmhara frz yad dlata hwn kh apnay khandan ky dykh bhal krw۔\"" ayk nskhh hay \""khda ky ktab khda ky rsy hay، jw as ky pyrwy krta hay as kay lyay hdayt hay awr jw asay chhwrta hay wh gmrahy myn hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6141","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh jb anhwn nay jafr kay bytay kw slam kya tw kha: alslam alykm prwn walay kay bytay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6142","braa rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw hsn rzy allh anh kay sath dykha۔ aly nay apnay kndhay pr rkh kr kha، \aay khda، myn as say mhbt krta hwn، as lyay myn tjh say altja krta hwn kh as say mhbt kr۔\"" bkhary w mslm۔"""""
"6143","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh ayk dn wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath nklay، jb wh fatmh rzy allh anha kay khymay myn phnchay tw frmaya: kya whan thwra sa tkra hay؟ mtlb hsn۔ ayk lmhay myn wh dwrta hwa aaya awr jb wh ayk dwsray kw glay lga chkay tw khda kay rswl nay kha kh aay allh myn as say mhbt krta hwn as lyay myn tjh say altja krta hwn kh as say mhbt kr awr jw as say mhbt krtay hyn an say mhbt kr۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6144","abwbkrh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh kw mnbr pr hsn bn kay sath dykha۔ aly as kay phlw myn۔ wh ayk dm lwgwn ky trf awr dwsray lmhay apny trf dykh rha tha awr khh rha tha kh myra yh byta syd hay awr shayd allh taalyٰ as kay zryaay mslmanwn ky dw bry jmaatwn myn slh kra day۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6145","abdalrhmn by۔ abw nam nay kha kh anhwn nay abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh kw sna۔ amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb ayk shkhs nay an say ahram bandhnay kay baray myn pwchha (shabh nay kha kh wh asay mkhywn kw marnay kay baray myn swchtay thay)، \araq kay lwg mjh say mkhywn kay baray myn pwchhtay hyn jb anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky byty kay bytay kw qtl kya hay، jn myn say dw lwgwn kay baray myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya hay kh wh dnya myn as ky awlad hyn!"""""
"6146","ans rzy allh anh nay kha kh hsn rzy allh anh say zyadh kwyy bhy nby sly allh alyh wslm say mshabht nhyn rkhta۔ aly، awr anhwn nay hsyn kay baray myn yh bhy kha kh wh wh shkhs tha js nay khda kay rswl say sb say zyadh mshabht payy thy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6147","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay apnay synay say lgaya awr frmaya: aay allh asay hkmt skha day۔ ayk wrzhn myn \asay ktab skhao۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6148","anhwn nay kha: nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ghsl khanay myn dakhl hwyay awr myn nay aap kay lyay pany rkha۔ bahr nkl kr as nay pwchha kh yh ks nay rkha hay، jb asay btaya gya tw as nay kha، \aay khda asay dyn kay baray myn bsyrt ata frma۔\"" bkhary w mslm۔"""""
"6149","asamh by zyd nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hsn awr an kw lay jatay thay awr khtay thay: aay allh myn tjh say an say mhbt krnay ky drkhwast krta hwn kywnkh myn an say mhbt krta hwn۔ ayk rwayt myn as nay btaya kh khda ka rswl asay lay kr apnay ghtnay pr bthatay thay، phr alhsn kw dwsray ghtnay pr rkhtay thay، awr an kw glay lganay kay bad khtay thay، \aay khda، myn tjh say an pr rhm krnay ky drkhwast krta hwn، kywnkh mjhay an pr trs aata hay۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6150","abdallh by amr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk lshkr rwanh kya js ka ancharj asamh rzy allh anh kw mqrr kya۔ zyd awr kchh lwgwn nay as ky tqrry pr tnqyd ky، as nay kha kh agr tm as ky tqrry pr tnqyd krtay hw tw tm nay as say phlay bhy as kay wald ky tqrry kay baray myn aysa hy kya hay، myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh wh kmandr kay ahday kay layq thay، wh an lwgwn myn say thay jw mjhay sb say zyadh azyz thay، awr yh kh yh shkhs an lwgwn myn say hay jw apnay bad mjhay sb say zyadh azyz hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) mslm kay ayk nskhh myn bhy kchh aysa hy asr hay js kay aakhr myn yh alfaz aatay hyn \myn aap kw as ky taryf krta hwn kywnkh wh aap kay rast bazwn myn say hay۔\"""""""
"6151","anhwn nay btaya kh wh zyd kw khtay thay۔ harsh، khda kay rswl ky mokl، srf zyd bn۔ mhmd sly allh alyh wslm yhan tk kh qraan myn yh aayt nazl hwyy kh ’’anhyn an kay bap dada kay nam say pkarw‘‘۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) albraa ky wh rwayt js myn anhwn nay aly say kha kh tm mjh say talq rkhtay hw، bab myn nwjwanwn kay blwght awr bchpn myn an ky srprsty ka zkr kya gya hay۔"
"6152","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay arfh kay dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apny awntny qswa pr byth kr hj krtay hwyay dykha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aap kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh aay lwgw myn nay tm myn aysy chyz chhwry hay kh agr tm as pr qaym rhw gay tw gmrah nhyn hw gay، allh ky ktab awr myray qryby rshth dar jw myray ghr walay hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6153","zyd by۔ arqm nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya kh myn tm myn ayk aysy chyz chhwr kr ja rha hwn kh agr tm asay tham lw gay tw myray janay kay bad gmrah nhyn hw gay، as ka ayk hsh dwsray say zyadh ahm hay: ktab khda، aasman say zmyn tk phyly hwyy rsy awr myray qryby rshth dar jw myray ghr say talq rkhtay hyn، yh dwnwn ayk dwsray say jda nhyn hwn gay، yhan tk kh myray bad tm pr kysay aml kya jayay ga۔ rwangy۔\ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6154","anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aly، fatmh، hsn awr hsyn rzy allh anh kay baray myn frmaya: myn as say jng krnay wala hwn jw an say jng kray awr jw an say slh kray as say myn slamty hwn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6155","jmah b۔ amyr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn apny phwphy kay sath aayshh rzy allh anha ky ayadt kay lyay gya awr pwchha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw sb say zyadh pyara kwn hay؟ jb as nay jwab dya kh yh fatmh hyn tw an say pwchha gya kh mrdwn myn sb say zyadh pyara kwn hay tw jwab dya kh yh as ka shwhr hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6156","abd almtlb b۔ rbyah nay kha: ayk mrtbh jb myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas tha tw abas rzy allh anh ghsay myn aayay، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha kh aap kw ks chyz say ghsh aarha hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \hmaray awr qrysh myn kya khraby hay؟ jb wh ayk dwsray say mltay hyn tw khwsh mzajy say aysa krtay hyn، lykn jb wh hm say mltay hyn tw an ka brtao mkhtlf hay۔\"" khda kay rswl kw as qdr ghsh aaya kh aap ka chhrh srkh hw gya awr phr frmaya kh as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، ayman ksy aadmy kay dl myn as wqt tk dakhl nhyn hw ga jb tk kh khda awr as kay rswl ky khatr tm say mhbt nh kray۔ phr frmaya aay lwgw js nay myray chcha kw zkhmy kya as nay mjhay zkhmy kya kywnkh aadmy ka chcha as kay bap kay brabr hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ almsabyh myn yh almtlb ky snd say dya gya hay (ayk shkhs almtlb bn rbyah awr abd almtlb bn rbyah bhy thay، jw dwnwn rswl allh kay ashab thay، lykn aysa lgta hay kh msabyh alsnh myn ghlty hw gyy hay، ghalbaً aad myn ghlty hw gyy hay)۔"""""
"6157","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh abas mjh say talq rkhtay hyn awr myn an say۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6158","anhwn nay btaya kh khda kay rswl nay abas say kha: \jb pyr ky sbh aayay tw apnay bchwn kw lay kr myray pas aana takh myn aap kay lyay ayk daa krwn js say khda aap kw awr aap kay bchwn kw faydh phnchayay۔\"" wh awr wh sbh kw aayay، awr jb as nay apny chadr an pr daly tw kha: \""aay allh، abas awr an ky awlad kw aysy bkhshsh ata frma jw kh gnah nh chhwray، aay allh، an ky awlad myn as ky hfazt frma۔\"" trmzy nay asay nql kya hay، awr razyn nay mzyd kha، \""awr khlaft kw an ky awlad myn baqy rkhyn۔\"" trmzy nay kha yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6159","as nay btaya kh myn nay jbrayyl kw dw bar dykha hay awr allh kay rswl nay an pr dw bar drwd bhyja hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6160","as nay kha: allh kay rswl nay myray lyay dw bar daa ky kh allh mjhay aql day۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6161","abwhryrh nay byan kya kh jafr ghrybwn say mhbt krta tha۔ wh an kay sath bythta awr an say batyn krta awr wh as say batyn krtay۔ khda ka rswl asay knyh abwalmsakyn (ghrybwn ka bap) khh kr mkhatb kya krta tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6162","as nay khda kay rswl kw byan krtay hwyay kha kh myn nay jafr kw frshtwn kay sath jnt myn prwaz krtay dykha۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6163","abw sayd rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh frmaya: hsn awr hsyn jnt myn janay walay nwjwanwn myn say srfhrst hwn gay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6164","abn amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hsn awr hsyn dnya myn myry awlad hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ yh phlay hsay myn hw chka hay۔"
"6165","asamh by zyd rzy allh anh khtay hyn: myn ayk rat nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas apny zrwrt kay lyay gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm apny chadr kay nychay kchh lay kr aayay (mjhay nhyn malwm tha)۔ jb myn asay apna karwbar bta chka tw myn nay as say pwchha kh as ky chadr kay nychay kya hay، jb as nay asay khwla tw myn nay hsn awr hsyn kw apnay kwlhwn pr dykha۔ as nay phr kha، \yh myray bytay awr myry byty kay bytay hyn۔ 0 khda، myn an say mhbt krta hwn، lhza myn an say awr an say mhbt krnay walwn say mhbt krnay ky drkhwast krta hwn۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6166","slmh nay kha: myn am slmh ky ayadt kay lyay andr gyy tw anhyn rwty hwyy payy۔ myn nay as say pwchha kh asay rwnay ky kya wjh hay tw as nay jwab dya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw (khwab myn) an kay sr awr darhy pr mty kay sath dykha hay۔ as nay as say pwchha kh kya maamlh hay tw as nay jwab dya kh myn abhy qtl hsyn kay mwqa pr hazr hwa hwn۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6167","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh aap kay khandan ka kwn sa frd aap kw sb say zyadh pyara hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hsn w alhsyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm fatmh rzy allh anh say khtay kh myray dwnwn bytwn kw myray pas blao، phr anhyn swngh kr glay lgatay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6168","brydh nay btaya kh jb rswl khda lwgwn say khtab kr rhay thay tw hsn awr hsyn srkh qmyzwn myn chltay hwyay thwkryn khatay hwyay aayay۔ phr khda kay rswl mnbr say atray، anhyn atha kr apnay samnay rkha، phr frmaya: \khda nay sch kha hay kh tmhara mal awr tmhary awlad mhz ayk ftnh hay۔\"" myn nay an dwnwn lrkwn kw chltay hwyay thwkryn khatay hwyay dykha، awr apnay khtab myn rkawt dalnay awr anhyn athanay say baz nh aa ska۔\"" asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"6169","yala b۔ mrh nay khda kay rswl ky khbr dy kh \hsyn mjh say talq rkhta hay awr myn as say۔ khda as say mhbt kray jw hsyn say mhbt krta hay! hsyn ayk pwta hay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6170","aly nay kha kh hsn synh say sr tk rswl khda say mshabh tha awr hsyn as say nychay pyghmbr say mshabh thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6171","hzyfh rzy allh anh nay kha: myn apny waldh say khta hwn kh wh mjhay nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas janay dyn، aap kay sath ghrwb aaftab ky nmaz prhyn، awr an say apnay awr myray lyay mghfrt ky daa kryn۔ myn nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap kay sath ghrwb aaftab ky nmaz prhy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nmaz myn rhay yhan tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay rat ky nmaz prh ly۔ jb wh chla gya tw myn as kay pychhay pychhay chla، jb as nay myry aawaz sny tw as nay kha yh kwn hay kya hzyfh hay؟ jb myn nay as say kha kh aysa hay tw as nay kha، \tmhyn kya chahyay؟ khda tmhyn awr tmhary man kw maaf kray! yhan ayk frshth hay jw aaj rat say phlay kbhy zmyn pr nhyn aaya، as nay apnay rb say ajazt tlb ky kh wh mjhay slam kray awr mjhay khwshkhbry day kh fatmh jnt walwn myn say srdar hwn gy، awr yh kh hsn awr hsyn jnt kay jwanwn myn say srdar hwn gay۔\"" trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6172","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hsn rzy allh anh kw lay ja rhay thay۔ aly kw kndhay pr rkh kr ayk aadmy nay kha kh tm ayk amdh syrhy pr swar hw gyay hw lrkay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya awr wh ayk bhtryn swar hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6173","amr rzy allh anh nay asamh kw tyn hzar panch sw awr abdallh bn abas kw۔ amr tyn hzar، chnanchh abdallh bn amr rzy allh anh nay apnay wald say kha kh tm nay asamh kw mjh say afzl kywn smjha hay، khda ky qsm mjh say phlay wh kbhy ksy jng myn nhyn aayay۔ as nay jwab dya kh yh as lyay kh zyd rswl khda kw tmharay bap say zyadh mhbwb thay awr asamh tm say zyadh khda kay rswl kw pyaray thay as lyay myn nay as shkhs kw trjyh dy jw rswl allh kw mhbwb tha as pr jw mjhay mhbwb hay asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6174","jbalh by۔ harsh nay kha: myn khda kay rswl kay pas aayy awr kha kh khda kay rswl myray bhayy zyd kw myray sath bhyj dyn۔ as nay jwab dya kh wh hazr hay، agr wh tmharay sath jayay tw myn asay nhyn rwkwn ga۔ lykn jb zyd nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myn khda ky qsm khata hwn kh myn aap pr ksy kw trjyh nhyn dyta،\"" myn nay apnay bhayy ky rayay kw apny rayay say bhtr smjha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6175","asamh by zyd nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm lwg bht kmzwr hw gyay awr myn mdynh aa gya۔ myn khda kay rswl say mlnay gya jw zban bndhay hwyay thay awr bwlnay say qasr thay: lykn wh mjh pr hath rkh kr anhyn atha rhay thay، awr myn nay phchan lya kh wh mjh pr drwd bhyj rhay hyn۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6176","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh ayk mrtbh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asamh ky nak pwnchhna chahy tw anhwn nay as ky ajazt chahy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aayshh rzy allh anha say mhbt krw kywnkh myn an say mhbt krty hwn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6177","asamh nay byan kya kh jb wh bythay hwyay thay tw aly awr abas rzy allh anh andr dakhl hwnay ky ajazt lynay aayay۔ anhwn nay as say kha kh khda kay rswl say dakhl hwnay ky ajazt tlb krw، awr as nay kha: \khda kay rswl، aly awr abas dakhl hwnay ky ajazt mang rhay hyn۔\"" as nay pwchha kh kya wh janta hay kh an kw kya laya hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh myn nhyn krta، tw as nay kha، \""lykn myn janta hwn، anhyn ajazt dw۔\"" phr jb wh dakhl hwyay tw khnay lgay kh aay khda kay rswl hm aap say yh pwchhnay aayay hyn kh aap kay khandan ka kwn sa frd aap kw sb say zyadh azyz hay؟ as kay jwab myn kh \""fatmh، mhmd ky byty\""، anhwn nay kha، \""hm aap say aap kay qryby khandan kay baray myn pwchhnay nhyn aayay hyn،\"" tw aap nay frmaya، \""myray khandan myn sb say zyadh pyara wh hay js pr khda nay ahsan kya awr js pr myn nay ahsan kya، yany asamh bn zyd۔\"" anhwn nay pwchha kh aagay kwn aaya، tw as nay jwab dya kh yh aly rzy allh anh hyn۔ abw talb، alabas rzy allh anh nay kha، \""khda kay rswl، aap nay apnay chcha kw an myn say aakhry bnaya hay۔\"" as nay jwab dya kh aly nay tm say phlay hjrt ky thy۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ zkw ky ktab myn yh btaya gya hay kh aadmy ka chcha bhy as kay bap jysa hy hwta hay۔"""""
"6178","aqbh b۔ hars nay byan kya kh zhr ky nmaz prh kr abwbkr nklay awr aly kay sath chl pray۔ as nay hsn kw lrkwn kay sath khyltay hwyay dykha awr asay apnay kndhay pr athatay hwyay kha: \myray bap as ka fdyh hw! wh nby say mshabht rkhta hay awr aly say mshabht nhyn rkhta۔\"" as dwran aly hns rha tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6179","ans nay kha: jb abydallh bn zyad kw hsyn ka mala laya gya awr asay ayk brtn myn dala gya، as nay asay thpthpa kr as ky khwbswrty kay baray myn kchh kha، tw myn nay kha، \khda ky qsm kh wh as wqt khda kay rswl say zyadh mshabh tha۔\"" wh andgw say rnga hwa tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ trmzy ky rwayt myn as nay kha: myn abn zyad kay sath tha jb alhsyn ka sr laya gya awr as nay chhry say as ky nak pr thpthpaya awr kha kh myn nay as shkhs jysa hsyn shkhs ksy kw nhyn dykha۔ myn nay kha، \""myn aap kw yqyn dlata hwn kh wh an lwgwn myn say thay jw khda kay rswl say zyadh mshabht rkhtay thay۔\"" trmzy nay kha yh shyh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6180","am alfzl bnt alhars nay byan kya kh wh khda kay rswl say mlnay kay lyay andr gyyn awr kha kh aay khda kay rswl myn nay kl rat ayk qabl aatraz khwab dykha۔ as nay pwchha kh yh kya hay awr as nay jwab dya، \yh khwfnak tha۔\"" as nay pwchha lykn yh kya tha؟ awr as nay jwab dya، \""myn nay dykha kh aap kay jsm ka ayk tkra kat kr apny gwd myn rkha gya hay۔\"" as nay kha tm nay kchh achha dykha hay agr khda nay chaha tw fatmh ayk byta pyda kray gy jw tmhary gwd myn hwga۔ phr fatmh nay hsyn kw jnm dya jw as ky gwd myn rkha gya jysa kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya tha۔ ayk dn wh khda kay rswl kw dykhnay kay lyay andr gyy awr asay apny gwd myn btha lya۔ as nay mr kr dykha awr khda kay rswl ky aankhwn say grtay aansw dykh kr khnay lgy: \""khda kay nby js kay bdlay myn apnay wald awr waldh kw fdyh kay twr pr dwn ga، tmhyn kya hwa؟\"" as nay jwab dya kh jbrayyl myray pas aayay awr mjhay khbr dy kh myry qwm myray as bytay kw qtl kr day gy۔ as nay pwchha kh kya waqay as ka mtlb yh hay awr as nay jwab dya، \""han، awr wh mjhay srkh mty ka ayk tkra laya tha۔\"""""""
"6181","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh ayk dn dwphr kay wqt myn nay khwab myn dykha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay hath myn khwn ky bwtl thy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm pr ghbar aalwd thay awr frmaya: ”tm js kay bdlay myn apnay wald awr waldh kw fdyh myn dwn ga، yh kya hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh yh hsyn awr an kay sathywn ka khwn hay jsay myn aaj tk jma kr rha hwn۔ as nay btaya kh wh as wqt ka hsab lga rha tha awr pth chla kh as wqt asay qtl kr dya gya tha۔ byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn dw rwaytyn nql ky hyn awr ahmd nay dwsry rwayt ky۔"
"6182","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \khda say mhbt krw an namtwn kay lyay jw wh tmhyn dyta hay، mjh say khda ky mhbt ky wjh say mhbt krw، awr myry mhbt say myray ghr walwn say mhbt krw۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6183","abwzr rzy allh anh nay kabh ka drwazh pkrtay hwyay btaya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh tm myn myra khandan nwh ky kshty ky trh hay، jw as pr swar hw ga wh mhfwz rhay ga lykn jw as say pychhay rhay ga wh hlak hw jayay ga۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6184","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh apnay zmanay ky bhtryn awrt mrym bnt amran thy awr apnay zmanay ky bhtryn khatwn khdyjh bnt khwyld hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm) ayk rwayt myn abw kryb nay kha kh wkya nay aasman awr zmyn ky trf asharh kya۔"
"6185","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jbrayyl alyh alslam nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha kh allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm yh hyn khdyjh jw ayk brtn lay kr aayy hyn js myn msalhh jat awr khanay hyn، jb wh aayyn tw anhyn apnay rb ky trf say awr myry trf say slam khw awr anhyn khwshkhbry dw kh jnt myn an kay lyay shandar mwtywn ka ghr hw ga js myn kwyy shwr w ghl nhyn hw ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6186","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: mjhay nby sly allh alyh wslm ky ksy bywy say atny ghyrt nhyn thy jtny khdyjh say thy۔ myn nay asay kbhy nhyn dykha، lykn wh aksr as ka zkr krta tha، awr wh aksr ayk bhyr kw mar dalta، asay tkray tkray kr kay khdyjh ky shylywn myn bhyj dyta۔ myn aksr as say khta tha kh \aysa lgta hay kh khdyjh dnya ky wahd awrt hyn\"" tw as nay jwab dya، \""wh waqay ayk achhy awrt thy، awr mjhay an say awlad hwyy hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6187","abw slmh nay byan kya kh aayshh rzy allh anha nay anhyn khbr dy kh ayk bar jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jbrayyl alyh alslam yhan hyn، aayshh [*]، awr tmhyn slam kr rhay hyn، tw anhwn nay jwab dya، \awr an pr slamty awr rhmt hw،\"" anhwn nay mzyd kha kh wh wh chyz dykhtay thay jw wh nhyn kr skty thyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6188","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: mjhay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay btaya kh mjhay tyn rat khwab myn ayk frshth ryshm kay kpray myn laya hwa dkhaya gya، as nay an say kha: yh tmhary bywy hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb aap kay chhray say kpra htaya gya tw aap hy thay، tw myn nay kha kh agr yh khda ky trf say hay tw asay athayay“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6189","as nay btaya kh lwg apnay thfay lanay kay lyay aayshh kay dn ka antkhab krtay thay، as trh allh kay rswl kw khwsh krnay kay lyay۔ as nay kha kh khda kay rswl ky azwaj mthrat dw jmaatwn myn thyn ayk myn aayshh، hfsh، sfyh awr swdh awr dwsry myn am slmh awr baqy azwaj am slmh rzy allh anha nay as say bat ky awr as say kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say khw kh lwgwn say khw kh agr kwyy chahta hay kh myn asay pysh krwn tw myn asay pysh krwn۔ wh jhan bhy hwta hay۔\ as nay aysa hy kya tw aap nay frmaya: aayshh rzy allh anha kay baray myn mjhay tng nh krw، kywnkh jb myn ksy awrt kay lbas myn thy tw aayshh rzy allh anha kay alawh mjh pr kwyy alham nhyn tha۔ as nay kha، myn allh say twbh krty hwn kh aap kw naraz kya، khda kay rswl۔ as kay bad anhwn nay fatmh kw blaya، asay khda kay rswl kay pas bhyja، awr as nay as say bat ky، lykn as nay jwab dya، \""kya tmhyn wh psnd nhyn jw myn psnd krta hwn، lrky؟\"" as nay kha، \""zrwr،\"" tw as nay kha؛ \""tw phr as awrt say pyar krw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm۔) hzrt ans ky rwayt \""aayshh ky awrtwn pr fzylt...\"" abw mwsyٰ kay akhtyar pr abtdayay tkhlyq kay bab myn mzkwr hay۔"""""
"6190","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmharay lyay sary kaynat ky awrtwn myn mrym bnt amran، khdyjh bnt khwyld، fatmh bnt mhmd awr aasyh zwjh frawn kafy hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6191","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jbrayyl alyh alslam sbz ryshm kay ayk tkray pr an ky tswyr lay kr aayay awr kha kh yh dnya awr aakhrt myn aap ky bywy hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6192","ans nay byan kya kh jb sfyh nay sna kh hfsh nay anhyn yhwdy ky byty kha tw wh rw pryn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm whyn tshryf layay jb wh rw rhy thy awr as say pwchha kh asay rwnay ky kya wjh hay، jb as nay asay btaya kh hfsh nay asay yhwdy ky byty kha hay tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm nby ky byty hw، tmharay chcha nby thay awr tmhary shady ayk nby say hwyy hay، tw asay tm pr fkhr krnay ky kya zrwrt hay؟ as kay bad frmaya hfsh khda ka khwf krw۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6193","am slmh nay byan kya kh fth kay sal khda kay rswl nay fatmh kw blaya awr an say razdary myn bat ky awr wh rw pryn۔ as nay phr as say bat ky awr wh hns dy۔ jb khda kay rswl ky wfat hwyy tw as nay as say as kay rwnay awr as kay hnsnay kay baray myn pwchha tw as nay jwab dya kh khda kay rswl nay mjhay khbr dy thy kh wh mrnay wala hay tw myn rw pry، phr as nay mjhay btaya kh mrym bnt amran kay alawh myn jnt walwn myn say srdar khatwn hwn gy tw myn hns pry۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6194","abw mwsyٰ nay kha: hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathywn nay aayshh rzy allh anha say ksy aysy rwayt kay baray myn nhyn pwchha js kay baray myn hmyn shk hw awr yh nh malwm hw kh anhyn as ka kchh alm tha۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6195","mwsyٰ by۔ tlhh nay kha kh myn nay aayshh rzy allh anha say zyadh pakyzh ksy kw nhyn dykha۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6196","abdallh by amr rzy allh anh nay kha: khwab myn mjhay apnay hath myn ryshm ka ayk tkra nzr aaya awr myn nay jnt myn kwyy jgh nhyn bnayy jb tk kh wh myray sath ar nh jayay۔ myn nay hfsh kw as kay baray myn btaya، awr jb anhwn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \tmhara bhayy achha aadmy hay\"" ya \""abdallh achha aadmy hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6197","hzyfh rzy allh anh khtay hyn: jw shkhs rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say jlawtny، rhn shn awr trz aml myn sb say zyadh mshabht rkhta tha wh abn am abd rzy allh anh thay jb wh ghr say nklay yhan tk kh waps lwt aayay، lykn hmyn yh nhyn malwm tha kh jb wh apnay ghr walwn kay sath akylay thay tw an kay sath kysa slwk krtay thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6198","abw mwsyٰ ashary nay kha: myn awr myra bhayy ymn say aayay thay awr kafy arsh tk hmyn malwm nhyn tha kh abdallh bn msawd nby sly allh alyh wslm kay khandan kay ayk frd kay alawh tha kywnkh wh awr an ky waldh ktny bar nby sly allh alyh wslm say mlnay jatay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6199","abdallh by amrw nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \char lwgwn say qraan prhnay kw khw: abdallh bn msawd، abw hzyfh kay salm mokl، aby bn kab awr maaz bn jbl۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6200","alqmh nay kha: myn dmshq gya awr jb myn nay dw rkat nmaz prhy tw myn nay khda say daa ky kh wh mjhay achha sathy ata frmayay۔ phr myn kchh lwgwn kay pas aaya awr an kay pas byth gya awr ayk bwrha aadmy aakr myray pas byth gya۔ jb myn nay pwchha kh wh kwn hay awr mjhay btaya gya kh wh abw drdaa hyn tw myn nay kha kh myn nay khda say mjhay ayk achha sathy frahm krnay ky drkhwast ky thy awr as nay mjhay aap say nwaza hay۔ as nay mjh say pwchha kh myn kwn hwn، jb myn nay btaya kh myra talq kwfh say hay tw as nay kha: kya tm myn abn am abd nhyn hay jw jwtay، tkyh awr wzw yany brtn ky dykh bhal krta tha awr wh shkhs jsay allh taalyٰ nay apnay nby ky zban say shytan say mhfwz rkha tha (yany amar rzy allh anh nay tm myn say kwyy nby nhyn tha) awr kya tm myn say wh shkhs nhyn hay jw tm myn say hay؟ wh raz jnhyn as kay swa kwyy nhyn janta tha\ (mtlb hzyfh)؟ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6201","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay jnt dkhayy gyy awr abwtlhh rzy allh anh ky bywy kw dykha awr myn nay apnay samnay srsraht sny، awr blal rzy allh anh bhy thay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6202","sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb hm myn say chh aadmy nby sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay tw mshrkyn nay aap sly allh alyh wslm say kha: an lwgwn kw bhga dw awr anhyn hm say mkhatb hwnay ky jrt nh hwnay dyn۔ myn mwjwd tha، abn msawd، hzyl kay ayk shkhs، blal awr dw aadmy jn kay nam mjhay yad nhyn thay۔ phr jw kchh khda nay chaha wh khda kay rswl kay zhn myn aaya awr as nay as kay baray myn swcha۔ as kay bad allh taalyٰ nay nazl frmaya kh jw lwg sbh w sham apnay rb kw pkartay hyn awr as kay chhray kw tlash krtay hyn anhyn dwr nh krw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6203","abwmwsyٰ nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya kh tmhyn daod kay paypwn myn say ayk abw mwsyٰ dya gya hay۔ bkhary w mslm۔"
"6204","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn char lwg pwray qraan kw jantay thay: aby bn۔ kab، maaz b۔ jbl، zyd by۔ sabt awr abw zyd۔ ans say pwchha gya kh abw zyd kwn hyn tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh wh aap kay chcha myn say hyn۔ bkhary w mslm۔"
"6205","khbab b۔ alarat nay kha: hm nay khda kay rswl kay sath hjrt ky takh khda ky zat aalyٰ ky tlash myn hw، tw hmara ajr khda ky trf say mlay ga۔ hm myn say kchh aysay gzray hyn kh an kay swab myn say kwyy faydh nhyn hwa، abdallh bn msawd jn myn msab bn thay۔ amyr jw jng ahd myn mara gya tha، js kay lyay kfn kay twr pr srf ayk mwta kpra ml skta tha۔ jb hm nay as ka sr dhanp lya tw as kay paon nmwdar hwyay awr jb hm nay as kay paon kw dhanp lya tw as ka sr zahr hwa tw nbyﷺ nay frmaya kh as ka sr dhanp dw awr as kay paon pr kchh dal dalw۔ hm myn say kchh aysay bhy thay jn kay lyay an ka phl phwla hwa tha awr wh asay twr rhay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6206","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: sad bn maaz ky wfat say arsh lrz gya۔ ayk rwayt myn frmaya kh sad bn maaz ky wfat say rhmn ka arsh lrz gya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6207","braa rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ayk ryshmy chadr pysh ky gyy، aap kay shabh asay chhwnay lgay awr as ky nrmy pr tajb krnay lgay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm as ky nrmy pr tajb krtay hw؟ sad bn maaz rzy allh anh ka sr ky pty jnt myn as say bhtr awr nrm hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6208","am slym rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh anhwn nay kha kh allh kay rswl، ans aap kay bnday hyn، as kay lyay allh say daa kryn۔ as nay kha kh aay khda as ky jayydad awr as ky awlad myn kyy gna azafh kr awr jw kchh tw nay asay dya hay as myn asay brkt ata frma۔ ans rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myra mal bht zyadh hay awr myray bchay awr nwasay aaj kl tadad myn sw say zyadh hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6209","sad b۔ abw wqas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw rwyay zmyn pr chlnay walay ksy shkhs kw yh khtay hwyay nhyn sna kh wh jnt walwn myn say hw ga swayay abdallh kay۔ slam۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6210","qys b۔ abyd rzy allh anh nay kha: myn mdynh ky msjd myn bytha hwa tha kh ayk aadmy as kay chhray pr aajzy kay nshan lyay dakhl hwa، lwgwn nay kha kh yh jntywn myn say ayk hw ga۔ as nay dw rkat nmaz prhy، jsay as nay mkhtsr twr pr ada kya، phr jb wh bahr nklay tw myn as kay pychhay pychhay chla gya awr kha kh jb aap msjd myn dakhl hwyay tw lwgwn nay kha kh yh jntywn myn say hwga۔ as nay jwab dya kh myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh kwyy aysy bat khay jsay wh nhyn janta lykn myn aap kw as bat ky wzaht krta hwn kh khda kay rswl kay zmanay myn mjhay ayk rwya mly thy jw myn nay aap kw btayy thy myn apnay aap kw ayk bagh myn dykh rha tha (js ky wsat awr azmt ka zkr as nay kya) js kay bych myn aasman kay nychay ayk lwha tha js kay nychay ayk lwha tha۔ mjhay kha gya kh as pr chrh jao، jb myn nay jwab dya kh myray pas kwyy bndh nhyn aaya، myray pychhay kpray athayay awr myn as kay awpr phncha، phr myn nay hyndl kw pkr lya awr kha kh wh myray hath myn hay، myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh wh aslam ka hath hay۔ snbhal lw، tw mrtay dm tk aslam pr qaym rhw gay۔\ (qys nay kha) wh shkhs abdallh bn tha۔ slam۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6211","ans nay kha: sabt b۔ qys b۔ ansar myn say shmas fsyh thay awr jb yh aayt atry kh \aay ayman walw، apny aawazwn kw nby ky aawaz say blnd nh krw...\"" sabt apnay ghr myn thhray awr nby sly allh alyh wslm say dwr rhay۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay sad rzy allh anh say pwchha۔ maaz، \""sabt kw kya hwa؟ kya wh bymar hay؟\"" sad as kay pas gya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky batwn ka zkr kya awr sabt nay jwab dya kh yh aayt nazl hwyy hay awr tm jantay hw kh myn tm myn say wh hwn js ky aawaz allh kay rswl ky aawaz say blnd hay as lyay myn jhnm myn janay walwn myn say hwn۔ sad rzy allh anh nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say as ka zkr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nhyn، wh jnt myn janay walwn myn say hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6212","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath bythay hwyay thay kh swr aljma nazl hwyy۔ phr jb \awr an myn say dwsray jw abhy tk an myn shaml nhyn hwyay\"" kay alfaz atray tw lwgwn nay khda kay rswl say pwchha kh wh kwn hyn؟ slman farsy bhy hmaray drmyan thay awr nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay apna hath slman pr rkh kr frmaya kh agr ayman plydwn myn hwta tw an myn say kchh lwg asay hasl kr lytay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6213","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay rwayt kya kh aay allh apnay an chhwtay bndwn (yany abwhryrh rzy allh anh) awr an ky waldh kw apnay bndwn say zyadh mhbwb bna awr mwmnwn kw an say pyara bna۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6214","A'idh b. amrw nay byan kya kh abw sfyan awr kchh aadmy salmwn، shyb awr blal kay pas aayay، anhwn nay kha: allh kay dshmn ky grdn say allh ky tlwarwn ka hq nhyn hay۔ abwbkr nay phr kha: kya tm yh bat qrysh kay shykh awr aaqa say khtay hw؟ wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap kw btaya awr aap nay kha، \shayd aap nay anhyn naraz kya hay، abwbkr، awr agr aap nay aysa kya hay tw aap nay apnay rb kw naraz kya hay.\"" as lyay wh an kay pas gya awr kha، ’’kya myn nay tm kw naraz kya hay، myray bhayy؟‘‘ anhwn nay jwab dya، ’’nhyn، pyaray bhayy، allh aap kw maaf kray۔‘‘ mslm nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6215","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ayman ky alamt ansar say mhbt hay awr nfaq ky alamt ansar say bghz hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6216","albraa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh ansar say srf mwmn hy mhbt krta hay awr mnafq hy an say bghz rkhta hay، ps jw an say mhbt krta hay allh as say mhbt krta hay awr jw an say bghz rkhta hay allh as say bghz rkhta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6217","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb allh taalyٰ nay apnay rswl kw hwazn ka wh mal dya jw as nay anhyn dya tha awr qrysh kay aadmywn kw sw awnt dynay lgay tw ansar myn say kchh nay kha kh khda bkhsh day rswl allh! wh qrysh kw day rhay hyn awr hmyn nkal rhay hyn، phr bhy hmary tlwaryn an kay khwn say tpk rhy hyn۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw an ky bat btayy gyy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ansar kw blwa bhyja awr anhyn chmray kay khymay myn jma kya awr ksy kw an kay sath nh janay dya۔ phr jb wh jma hwyay tw khda ka rswl an kay pas aaya awr pwchha kh myn nay tmharay baray myn yh kya sna hay؟ an kay ahl alm nay jwab dya kh hm myn say jn ky rayay qabl ghwr hay، khda kay rswl nay tw kchh nhyn kha، lykn hmaray baz nwjwanwn nay kha hay kh khda khda kay rswl kw bkhsh day، wh qrysh kw day rhay hyn awr ansar kw chhwr rhay hyn، phr bhy hmary tlwaryn an kay khwn say tpk rhy hyn۔ khda kay rswl nay kha kh myn an lwgwn kw day rha hwn jw hal hy myn kafr hwyay hyn an pr fth hasl krnay kay lyay، kya tm as bat pr razy nhyn hw kh kchh lwg mal lay kr chlay jayyn awr tm khda kay rswl kay sath apnay ghrwn kw lwt jao؟'' anhwn nay jwab dya، ''yqyna aay khda kay rswl hm khwsh hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6218","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr hjrt nh hwty tw myn ansar myn say hwta، agr lwg ayk wady myn jayyn awr ansar dwsry wady myn jayyn tw myn ansar ky wady (ya phary rastay) myn jaon ga، ansar ayk batny lbas hyn awr ansanyt kay bad myn apnay aap kw dykhwn ga۔ dnyawy saman]، lykn jb tk tm mjh say talab pr nh mlw sbr krw۔\ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6219","anhwn nay kha: jb hm fth kay dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jw lwg abw sfyan kay ghr myn dakhl hwn gay wh mhfwz rhyn gay awr jw apnay hthyar rkh dyn gay wh mhfwz rhyn gay۔ ansar nay phr kha kh as shkhs kw apnay qbylay pr trs aaya hay awr apnay shhr say mhbt hay۔ alham alhy say as ka alm hasl krtay hwyay khda kay rswl nay frmaya، \tm nay kha hay kh aadmy kw apnay qbylay pr trs aaya hay awr apnay shhr say mhbt hay، aysa nhyn hay، myn khda ka bndh awr rswl hwn jw khda awr tmhary trf hjrt kr kay aaya hwn awr tmharay drmyan jywn ga awr mrwn ga۔\"" anhwn nay jwab dya kh hm khda ky qsm khatay hyn kh hm nay yh srf as lyay kha kh hm khda awr as kay rswl kw apnay pas rkhnay ky fkr myn thay۔ as nay kha khda awr as ka rswl tslym krtay hyn kh tm sch khh rhay hw awr maafy mangtay hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6220","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh lrkwn awr awrtwn kw shady say aatay hwyay dykha tw aap khray hwyay awr frmaya: ”bay shk tm mjhay sb say zyadh pyaray lwgwn myn say hw، tm an lwgwn myn say hw jw mjhay sb say zyadh azyz hyn“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6221","anhwn nay byan kya kh abwbkr awr abas rzy allh anhma ansar ky ayk mjls kay pas aayay jw rw rhay thay، jb anhwn nay pwchha kh an kay rwnay ky kya wjh hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh hmyn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky mlaqatyn yad hyn۔ an myn say ayk shkhs nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kw yh bat btayy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apny chadr ky pty apnay sr pr bandhy، mnbr pr chrha، wh kam jw as nay as dn kay bad nhyn kya، allh taalyٰ ky hmd w sna byan ky، phr kha kh myn ansar kw aap ky khdmt kay lyay sfarsh krta hwn، kywnkh wh myray qryby awr matmd hyn، anhwn nay an say jw wajb tha wh pwra kr dya، as lyay an say maafy mang ly۔ an myn say jw achhay kam krtay hyn awr an myn say jw bray kam krtay hyn an say drgzr krtay hyn۔\ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6222","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm as bymary myn tshryf lay gyay js myn aap ka antqal hw gya، mnbr pr byth kr allh ky hmd w sna byan ky، phr frmaya: aagay brhw: lwg bht hw jayyn gay awr ansar thwray hwn gay yhan tk kh wh lwgwn kay drmyan khanay myn nmk kay brabr hw jayyn gay، lhza agr tm myn say ksy kay pas aqtdar ka kwyy mqam hay js myn wh dwsrwn kw faydh phncha skta hay awr dwsrwn kw nqsan phncha skta hay tw asay chahyay kh wh an lwgwn kw qbwl kr lay jw dwsrwn kw nqsan phncha skay۔ an myn say jw bymar hyn an kw nzr andaz krw۔\ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6223","zyd by۔ arqm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay rwayt kya kh aay allh ansar، ansar kay bytwn awr ansar kay bytwn kw bkhsh day، asay mslm nay nql kya hay۔"
"6224","abw asyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ansar kay qbylwn myn sb say bhtr qbylh bn njar، phr bn abd ashhl، phr bn hars bn alkhzrj، phr bn saydh، awr ansar kay tmam qbylwn myn khyr hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6225","aly rzy allh anh nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay zbyr، almqdad awr mjhay bhyja (ayk nskhh js myn mqdad kay bjayay abw mrsd tha) awr frmaya: jao yhan tk kh tm khkh kay mydan myn phnchw، kywnkh whan ayk awrt awnt pr swar hay js kay pas ayk kht hay jsay tm as say lay lw۔ hm ghwrwn pr ayk dwsray kw dwratay hwyay chlay yhan tk kh ghas kay mydan myn phnchay awr jb hm nay awrt kw whan paya tw hm nay kha kh kht lao۔ as nay aalan kya kh as kay pas kwyy kht nhyn hay، tw hm nay kha، \aap kw kht nkalna chahyay ya apnay kpray atar dyna chahyay۔\"" as kay bad wh asay apnay kpray say nkal kr lay aayyn awr hm asay nby krym ﷺ kay pas lay gyay۔ as ka khtab hatb b say hwa۔ abw bltah، mkh kay baz mshrkyn kw khda kay rswl kay baray myn kchh malwmat day rhay hyn۔ as nay pwchha hatb yh kya hay؟ awr as nay jwab dya kh khda kay rswl myray sath jld bazy nh kryn، myn qrysh ka hlyf rha hwn awr an myn say nhyn، jb kh mhajryn myn say jw aap kay sath hyn an say rshth dary hay js kay zryaay wh mkh myn apnay mal awr ahl w ayal ky hfazt krtay hyn، chwnkh an kay zkhyray myn hwnay say mjhay yh faydh nhyn hwa tha، as lyay myn nay chaha kh an ky kwyy mdd krwn js say wh apnay talqat ky hfazt nh kr skyn۔ myray mzhb say artdad، ya aslam qbwl krnay kay bad kfr myn khwsh hwna۔\"" khda kay rswl nay kha as nay tm say sch kha hay awr amr nay kha kh khda kay rswl mjhay as mnafq ka sr qlm krnay dw۔ lykn khda kay rswl nay jwab dya، \""wh bdr myn mwjwd tha، awr aap kw kysay malwm hay kh wh as ka msthq hay؟ shayd khda nay bdr myn mwjwd lwgwn pr rhm ky ngah say dykha awr kha، 'jw chahw krw، kywnkh jnt tmharay lyay zamn hay۔'\"" ayk wrzhn hay \""tmhyn maaf kr dya gya hay۔\"" as kay bad allh taalyٰ nay nazl frmaya kh aay ayman walw myray awr apnay dshmnwn kw dwst nh bnao۔ yh jgh mdynh say mkh kay rastay myn thy، ghalbaً mkh say mdynh kay qryb۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6226","rfaa b۔ rafa rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jbrayyl alyh alslam nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha: aap an lwgwn kw kya smjhtay hyn jw bdr myn mwjwd thay؟ as nay jwab dya، \mslmanwn myn sb say bhtryn lwgwn myn say\"" ya as kay lyay alfaz۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh aysa hy hay an frshtwn kay sath jw bdr myn thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6227","hfsh rzy allh anha nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay kha kh mjhay amyd hay kh agr allh nay chaha tw bdr awr hdybyh myn mwjwd kwyy bhy shkhs jhnm myn nhyn jayay ga۔ as nay pwchha kh kya khdayay bzrg w brtr nay yh nhyn kha hay kh \tm myn say kwyy aysa nhyn hay jw as ky trf nh jayay\"" tw as nay jwab dya، \""kya tm nay asay yh khtay nhyn sna kh phr hm mtqywn kw njat dyn gay؟\"" ayk nskhh hay \""agr khda nay chaha tw an lwgwn myn say jw drkht pr mwjwd thay awr as kay nychay byat ky thy jhnm myn dakhl nhyn hw gy۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6228","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hdybyh kay dn hmary tadad ayk hzar char sw thy، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hm say frmaya: ”aaj tm zmyn pr sb say bhtr lwg hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6229","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \jw shkhs drh almrar pr jayay ga، as kw why kchh waps kr dya jayay ga jw bny asrayyl kw dya gya tha۔\"" sb say phlay as pr chrhnay walay hmaray ghr swar thay، by alkhzrj kay ghrswar dstay؛ phr sb lwg pychhay hw gyay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh tm sb kay gnah maaf hw jayyn gay swayay srkh awnt kay malk kay۔ hm as kay pas gyay awr kha kh aao awr khda kay rswl kw tmharay lyay astghfar krnay dw، lykn as nay jwab dya، \""myn as say bhtr hwn kh aap ka sathy myray lyay astghfar kray۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ ans ky rwayt hay kh anhwn nay aby bn say kha۔ kab، \""khda nay mjhay hkm dya hay kh myn aap kw qraan snaon\"" as kay bad ayk bab myn qraan ky bhtryn khswsyat ka zkr kya gya hay۔"""""
"6230","abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb myn apnay dw sathywn abw bkr awr amr ky nql krwn tw amar ky hdayt ky pyrwy krw awr abn am abd kay hkm kw mzbwty say pkrw۔“ hzyfh ka qwl hay kh ”abn msawd jw khta hay as pr yqyn krw“ kay bjayay ”myn amar kw pkrw“۔ asay mntql kya."
"6231","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr myn bghyr mshwrh kay ksy kw kmandr mqrr krwn tw abn am abd kw mqrr krwn ga۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6232","khysm aay by۔ abw sbrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn mdynh aaya awr allh say daa ky kh wh mjhay ayk achha sathy day js kay pas bythwn awr as nay mjhay abwhryrh rzy allh anh ata frmayay۔ myn as kay sath byth gya awr asay btaya kh myn nay khda say kha tha kh wh mjhay ayk achha sathy day js kay sath bythwn awr wh myray mwafq hw۔ as nay pwchha kh myn khan say aaya hwn tw myn nay jwab dya kh myra talq alkfh say hay awr khyr ky khwahsh awr tlash myn aaya hwn۔ phr frmaya kya tm myn say sad bn malk nhyn jn ky daayyn qbwl hwty hyn، abn msawd jw rswl allh kay wzw kay pany awr an kay jwtwn ky dykh bhal krtay thay، hzyfh jw allh kay rswl kay matmd thay، amar jn kw allh taalyٰ nay shytan say hfazt dy thy an ky zban pr dw nby awr ayk ktab pr ayman lanay walay۔ yany anjyl awr qraan۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6233","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”abwbkr achhay aadmy hyn، amr achhay aadmy hyn، abw abydh bn aljrah achhay aadmy hyn، asyd bn hzyr achhay aadmy hyn، sabt bn qys bn shmas achhay aadmy hyn، maaz bn jbl achhay aadmy hyn، maaz bn jbl achhay aadmy hyn۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"6234","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jnt tyn aadmywn ky khwahsh hay: aly، amar awr slman۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6235","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb amar rzy allh anh nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say mlnay kay lyay andr aanay ky ajazt chahy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”asay andr aanay dw، bht achhay aadmy kw khwsh aamdyd! asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6236","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \amar kw dw chyzwn myn say zyadh mshkl awr km kw mntkhb kyay bghyr akhtyar nhyn dya jata۔\"" trmzy nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6237","ans nay byan kya kh jb sad bn maaz ka byyr lay jaya gya mnafqwn nay kha kh as ka byyr ktna hlka hay! kh by qryzh kay baray myn as kay fyslay ky wjh say۔ jb nby sly allh alyh wslm kw yh btaya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”frshtay asay athayay hwyay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6238","abdallh by amrw nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: \aasman nay prdh nhyn athaya awr zmyn nay abwzr say zyadh scha kwyy nhyn athaya۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6239","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aasman nay ksy kw nhyn dhanpa hay awr zmyn nay abwzr say zyadh sch bwlnay walay ya apny bat pr zyadh wfadary krnay walay kw nhyn athaya، wh aysyٰ abn mrym say mshabht rkhta hay، yany snt prsty myn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6240","jb maaz b۔ jbl bstr mrg pr thay kh aap nay frmaya: char aadmywn say alm hasl krw، awymyr abw drdaa say، slman say، abn msawd say awr abdallh bn slam say jw yhwdy thay aslam layay، kywnkh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh wh jnt myn dakhl hwnay wala dswan shkhs hwga۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6241","hzyfh nay byan kya kh jb lwgwn nay yh khwahsh zahr ky kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ksy janshyn ka nam btayyn tw aap nay frmaya kh agr myn ksy janshyn ka nam dwn awr tm as ky nafrmany krw gay tw tmhyn sza mlay gy lykn hzyfh jw kchh tm say khay as pr yqyn krw awr jw abdallh tmhyn snayay why prhw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6242","aap nay frmaya: mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kay swa kwyy aysa nhyn js pr mjhay kwyy khwf nh hw۔ mslmh، kywnkh myn nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh \aazmaysh tmhyn nqsan nhyn day gy۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6243","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jb zbyr rzy allh anh kay ghr myn chragh dykha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myra khyal hay kh aayshh، asmaa rzy allh anha nay bchay kw jnm dya hw ga، jb tk myn aysa nh krwn as ka nam nh rkhw“۔ as ka nam abdallh rkha awr apnay hath say as kay talw kw try hwyy khjwr say rgra۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6244","abdalrhmn by۔ abwaamrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay maawyh rzy allh anh kay baray myn frmaya: ”aay allh asay hdayt yafth bna awr as say dwsrwn kw bhy hdayt day“۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6245","aqbh b۔ aamr nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan kya kh lwgwn nay aslam qbwl kr lya lykn amrw bn alaas ka ayman tha۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay js ky snd qwy nhyn hay۔"
"6246","jabr rzy allh anh nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say mlaqat ky awr frmaya: aay jabr، yh kysa hay kh myn aap kw mayws dykh rha hwn؟ myn nay jwab dya kh myray wald sahb awlad awr qrz chhwr kr shhyd hw gyay hyn۔ as nay pwchha kya myn tmhyn as bat ky khwshkhbry nh dwn kh khda nay tmharay bap kw ks chyz say mlaya hay؟ awr jb myn nay jwab dya، \yqynaً، khda kay rswl،\"" as nay kha، \""khda nay kbhy ksy say bat nhyn ky mgr prday kay pychhay say، lykn as nay aap kay wald kw zndh kya awr an say aamnay samnay bat ky kh aay myray bnday، agr aap mjh say kwyy khwahsh kryn tw myn asay ata krwn ga۔\"" as nay jwab dya: aay myray rb، myry khwahsh hay kh tw mjhay zndgy day awr mjhay apny khatr dwsry bar mar dala jayay lykn rb krym nay frmaya kh myn phlay hy khh chka hwn kh wh waps nhyn aayyn gay۔ phr nychay aaya، \""jw lwg rah khda myn maray gyay hyn an kw mrdh nh smjhw...\"" trmzy nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6247","as nay btaya kh allh kay rswl nay as kay lyay pchys bar astghfar kya۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6248","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bht say pragndh balwn awr ghbar aalwd jsm walay aysay hyn jw dw chythray hwyay kpray phntay hyn jn ky trf kwyy twjh nhyn dy jaty lykn agr wh as kay sath bdtmyzy kryn tw allh anhyn salh qrar day ga، an myn braa bn malk bhy hyn۔ trmzy awr byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn asay nql kya hay۔"
"6249","abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray matmd jn ky trf myn rjwa krta hwn wh myray ahl w ayal hyn awr myray qryby dwst ansar hyn، lhza an myn say jw lwg zlm krtay hyn an kw maaf kr dw awr an myn say jw nyky krtay hyn an ky azr qbwl krlw۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn rwayt hay۔"
"6250","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhnay wala kwyy ansar say bghz nh rkhay“۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"6251","ans nay abwtlhh say nql kya hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: \apny qwm kw slam krw، kywnkh jhan tk myn janta hwn، wh prhyzgar awr sbr krnay walay hyn۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6252","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh hatb ka ghlam nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas hatb ky shkayt kay lyay aaya awr kha: allh kay rswl، hatb yqynaً jhnm myn dakhl hwn gay۔ aap nay frmaya: tm jhwt bwltay hw، wh as myn dakhl nhyn hwga، kywnkh wh bdr awr hdybyh myn mwjwd tha۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6253","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy kh ”agr tm pyth phyr lw gay tw wh tmhary jgh dwsray lwgwn kw lay aayay ga awr wh tmharay jysay nh hwn gay“ tw lwgwn nay pwchha kh aay allh kay rswl yh kwn lwg hyn jn kay baray myn allh taalyٰ nay zkr frmaya hay kh agr hm plt jayyn gay tw wh hmaray bdlay hwn gay awr hmaray jysay nh hwn gay؟ as nay slman alfarsy kw ran pr mara awr kha، \yh shkhs awr as ky qwm، agr mzhb Pleiades myn hwta tw farsywn kay aadmy as tk phnch jatay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6254","anhwn nay btaya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky bargah myn ghyrwn ka zkr kya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjhay tm pr (ya tm myn say baz pr) as say zyadh bhrwsh an pr hay (ya an myn say baz pr)۔“ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6255","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \hr nby kay sat namwr aadmy hwtay hyn jw wly hwtay hyn، lykn mjhay chwdh ata kyay gyay hyn۔\"" aly rzy allh anh say pwchha gya kh wh kwn hyn tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn، myray dw bytay jafr، hmzh، abw bkr، amr، msab bn amyr، blal، slman، amar، abdallh bn msawd abwzr awr mqdad۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6256","khald by۔ wlyd nay kha: amar bn yasr awr myry bat hw gyy awr jb myn nay as say bat ky tw wh khda kay rswl kay pas gya awr as say myry shkayt ky۔ khald rzy allh anh aayay jb wh nby sly allh alyh wslm say shkayt kr rhay thay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm say bdtmyzy krnay lgay، js ka ntyjh yh nkla kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn mzyd ghsh dlaya۔ as dwran rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk lfz bhy nh bwlay khamwsh rhay tw amar rw pray awr khnay lgay ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kya aap an kw nhyn dykhtay؟ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apna sr athaya awr frmaya: ”jw amar say dshmny rkhta hay wh khda say dshmny rkhta hay awr jw amar say bghz rkhta hay khda as say bghz rkhta hay۔ khald rzy allh anh nay kha: phr myn bahr nkla، mjhay amar ky khyr khwahy say zyadh kwyy chyz azyz nh thy، tw myn nay an kay sath aysa slwk kya jw an kw psnd tha awr wh khwsh hwyay۔"
"6257","abw abydh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh khald rzy allh anh allh ky tlwarwn myn say ayk tlwar hay jw azym awr azym hay awr wh qbylh ka bhtryn jngjw hay۔ ahmd nay dwnwn rwaytyn nql ky hyn۔"
"6258","brydh nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha، \khda jw babrkt awr blnd hay as nay mjhay char lwgwn say mhbt krnay ka hkm dya hay، awr as nay mjhay btaya hay kh wh an say mhbt krta hay۔\"" aap say an ka nam lynay kw kha gya awr frmaya: ''aly an myn say ayk hyn (tyn bar khtay hyn) abwzr، mqdad awr slman bhy، as nay mjhay an say mhbt krnay ka hkm dya hay، awr mjhay btaya hay kh wh an say mhbt krta hay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"6259","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh amr rzy allh anh khtay thay kh abwbkr hmaray srdar hyn awr anhwn nay hmaray srdar kw chhwr dya، yany blal rzy allh anh۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6260","qys b۔ abwhazm nay byan kya kh blal nay abwbkr say kha kh agr tm nay mjhay srf apny khatr khryda hay tw mjhay rkh lyna awr agr tm nay mjhay srf khda kay lyay khryda hay tw mjhay janay dw awr khda ka kam krnay dw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6261","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb ayk aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr btaya kh wh tklyf myn hay tw as nay apny bywywn myn say ayk kw pygham bhyja، js nay aap kw hq kay sath bhyja hay as ky qsm hay kh myray pas pany kay swa kchh nhyn hay، as nay dwsray kw bhyja js nay aysa hy kha، jb sb nay yhy kha tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as ky tfryh kwn kray ga؟ ansar myn say ayk abw tlhh khlata hay atha awr khnay lga: \aay khda kay rswl، myn asay apnay ghr lay jaon ga awr as ky bywy say pwchha kh kya tmharay pas kchh hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh an kay pas bchwn kay khanay kay swa kchh nhyn hay، tw aap nay frmaya: \""anhyn ksy chyz say atar kr swnay dw۔ phr jb hmara mhman dakhl hwta hay tw asay yh khyal krta hay kh hm khana kha rhay hyn awr jb wh khanay kay lyay hath brhata hay tw athw، chragh kay pas jao awr asay bjhao۔\"" as nay aysa kya awr wh byth gyay awr mhman nay khaya lykn anhwn nay rat bhwky gzary، sbh kw wh khda kay rswl kay pas aaya js nay kha kh khda as say khwsh hay (ya، flan mrd nay aysy hy awrt pr mskraht ky hay) abw tlhh awr aakhr myn frmatay hyn kh allh taalyٰ nay phr yh nzwl frmaya kh ’’awr wh apnay awpr dwsrwn kw trjyh dytay hyn halankh wh mflsy myn mbtla hyn‘‘ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6262","anhwn nay kha: hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ayk khymh gah myn atray، jb lwg gzrnay lgay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha: abwhryrh yh kwn hay؟ awr myn asay btaon ga kh yh aysa hy tha۔ phr wh khay ga kh yh khda ka nyk bndh hay۔ wh ksy awr kay baray myn pwchhta awr jb myn nay asay btaya kh wh flan hay tw as nay kha kh yh khda ka bra bndh hay۔ yh slslh khald bn tk chla۔ alwlyd whan say gzra، jb as nay pwchha kh wh kwn hay tw myn nay jwab dya kh wh khald bn hyn۔ alwlyd nay kha، \khald bn۔ alwlyd khda ka achha bndh hay۔ wh khda ky tlwarwn myn say ayk tlwar hay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6263","zyd by۔ arqm nay byan kya kh jb ansar nay kha kh allh kay nby، hr nby kay pyrwkar hwtay hyn awr hm nay aap ky pyrwy ky hay، as lyay allh say daa kryn kh hmaray pyrwkar hmaray zmay hwn، tw aap nay aysa hy kya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6264","qtadh nay kha: hm arbwn ka kwyy qbylh nhyn jantay js myn ansar say zyadh shhdaa hwn ya qyamt kay dn an say zyadh blnd w bala hwn gay۔ anhwn nay byan kya kh ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh an myn say str jng ahd myn، str jng byr mawnh myn awr str abwbkr rzy allh anh kay zmanay myn jng ymamh myn maray gyay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6265","qys b۔ abwhazm nay byan kya kh bdr myn mwjwd hr ayk kw panch hzar ka atyh dya gya awr amr rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn an kw an kay bad aanay walwn pr zrwr fzylt dwn ga۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"6266","amr by alkhtab nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \tmharay pas awys namy shkhs ymn say aayay ga js kay pas srf ayk man rh jayay gy، wh kwrh myn mbtla tha awr as nay allh say daa ky kh wh ayk dynar (ya drhm) kay alawh sb kchh dwr kr day، agr tm myn say kwyy as say mlay tw apnay lyay astghfar kray۔\"" ayk rwayt myn as nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh \""awys namy ayk shkhs sb say bhtr pyrwkar hw ga js ky man hw awr wh jzam myn mbtla hw، as say khw kh wh tmharay lyay maafy mangay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"6267","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh ymn kay lwg tmharay pas aayay hyn، wh sb say nrm dl awr nrm dl hyn، ayman ymn ka hay awr hkmt ymn ky hay، awntwn kay malkwn myn tkbr awr ghrwr awr bhyr bkrywn kay malkwn myn prskwn jlawtny awr kshsh sql payy jaty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"6268","as nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \kfr ka chshmh mshrq ky trf hay؛ ghmnd awr ghrwr ghwrwn awr awntwn kay malkan awr awntwn kay khymwn myn rhnay walay baghbanwn myn paya jata hay؛ lykn prskwn jlawtny bhyrwn kay malkwn myn payy jaty hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"6269","abwmsawd ansary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn yhan say (mshrq ky trf asharh krta hwn) akhtlaf aaya hay awr rbyah awr mdr kay drmyan awntwn awr bylwn kay pychhay chlnay walay awntwn kay khymwn myn rhnay walay baghbanwn myn khrdra awr skht dl paya jayay ga۔"
"6270","jabr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh frmaya: mshrq myn skht dl awr khrdra pn paya jata hay lykn hjaz kay lwgwn myn ayman۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6271","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aay allh hmaray sham myn hmyn brkt day، ya allh hmaray ymn myn brkt day“۔ whan mwjwd lwgwn nay kha، \awr hmaray njd myn، khda kay rswl،\"" lykn as nay kha: \""aay khda، hmaray sham myn hmyn brkt day، 0 khda، hmaray ymn myn hmyn brkt day\""۔ hazryn nay kha awr hmaray njd myn khda kay rswl۔ abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh anhwn nay khyal kya kh myn nay tysray mwqa pr kha kh yhan zlzlay awr ftnay hyn awr as myn shytan ka syng athay ga۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"6272","ans nay zyd kw nql kya hay۔ sabt nay byan kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ymn ky trf dykha awr frmaya: aay allh an kay dlwn kw hmary trf phyr day awr hmaray saa awr hmaray md myn brkt ata frma۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6273","zyd by۔ sabt nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay kha، \mbark hay sham\"" awr jb as kay snnay walwn nay as say pwchha kh aysa kywn hay، tw as nay jwab dya، \""kywnkh rhmn kay frshtay as pr apnay pr phyla rhay hyn۔\"" asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"6274","abdallh by hzrt amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hdrmwt (ya hzrmwt say) ky trf say aag nklay gy awr lwgwn kw jma kray gy۔ as say pwchha gya kh aap nay an kw kya hkm dya hay tw jwab dya kh sham chlay jao۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6275","abdallh by amrw by alaas rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh hjrt kay bad hjrt hwgy awr sb say bhtr wh lwg hwn gay jw an jghwn pr jayyn jhan abrahym alyh alslam nay hjrt ky thy۔ ayk nskhh myn hay kh \zmyn pr bhtryn lwg wh hyn jw an jghwn kay qryb rhtay hyn jhan abrahym nay hjrt ky thy۔ as kay bdtryn lwg zmyn pr rhyn gay، apny zmynwn say nkalay jayyn gay، khda say nfrt kryn gay، bndrwn awr swrwn kay sath aag myn jma hwn gay jw rat awr dwphr whyn gzaryn gay jhan wh an ky shbt myn hwn gay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"6276","abn hwalh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \yh zahr hw ga kh aap mslh afwaj hwn gay، ayk sham myn، ayk ymn myn awr ayk araq myn۔\"" abn hwalh nay kha kh myray lyay khda kay rswl، agr myn as wqt phnch jaon tw chn lyjyay۔ as nay jwab dya kh sham ky trf chlw kywnkh yh khda ky mntkhb srzmyn hay js myn as kay bhtryn bnday jma hwn gay، lykn agr tm na chahtay hw tw apnay ymn myn jao awr apnay hwzwn say pany nkalw، kywnkh khda jw azym awr bzrg hay as nay sham awr as kay lwgwn ky khas zmh dary ly hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"6277","shwrayh by abyd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb aly rzy allh anh kay samnay ahl sham ka zkr hwa awr ksy nay kha kh aay amyr almwmnyn an pr lant bhyjw tw as nay ankar kr dya awr kha kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay sna tha kh chalys aadmywn kay mtbadl sham myn hwn gay awr jb kwyy mray ga tw allh taalyٰ as ky jgh dwsray kw khra kr day ga، an ky wjh say an pr barsh brsay gy awr an ky mdd ky jayay gy۔ an ky wjh say shamywn say msybt tal jayay gy\""6278"""""
"6278","Sahaba mein se ek shakhs se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: ""Shaam fatah hogi. Phir jab tumko uske makanat (rehayish ke maqamat) mein intikhab diya jaye, toh tumhara farz hai ke tum shehr Dimashq (Damascus) ko ikhtiyar karo, kyunki woh musalmanon ka ma'qil (qila/panahgah) hai malaahim (bari jangon) se, aur uska Fustat (lashkar gaah/maidaan) wahan hai jise Al-Ghouta kehte hain."" Isay Imam Ahmad ne riwayat kiya hai."
"6279","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khlaft mdynh myn hw gy awr badshahy sham myn“۔"
"6280","amr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh myn nay ayk nwr ka stwn dykha jw myray sr kay nychay say nkla awr sham tk phyl gya۔ byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn dwnwn rwayat nql ky hyn۔"
"6281","abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jng kay wqt mslmanwn ky mjls ka mqam alghwth myn hw ga jw dmshq namy shhr kay nzdyk sham kay bhtryn shhrwn myn say ayk hay۔ aba daod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"6282","abdalrhmn by۔ slyman nay kha kh kharjywn ka ayk badshah aayay ga awr dmshq kay alawh tmam shhrwn pr ghalb aayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"6283","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmhary mdt jw gzr chky hay an kay baray myn srf asr ky nmaz awr ghrwb aaftab kay drmyan ka wqt hay، tmhara awr yhwd w nsaryٰ ka mwaznh as aadmy ky trh hay js nay mzdwrwn pr kam kya awr kha: kwn myray lyay dwphr tk ayk qyrat kay lyay kam kray ga؟ yhwdywn nay dwphr tk ayk ayk qyrat kam kya، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: 'kwn myray lyay dwphr say lay kr asr ky nmaz tk ayk ayk qyrat kam kray ga؟' aysayywn nay dwphr say lay kr asr ky nmaz tk ayk ayk qyrat kay hsab say kam kya، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: 'kwn myray lyay zhr ky nmaz say lay kr ghrwb aaftab tk dw qyrat kay hsab say kam kray ga؟' myn aap kw yqyn dlata hwn kh aap wh hyn jw asr ky nmaz say lay kr ghrwb aaftab tk kam krtay hyn awr aap kw as ka dwgna ajr mlay ga۔ yhwd w nsaryٰ ghsay myn aagyay awr khnay lgay kh hm nay zyadh kam kya awr ajrt km ly، lykn khdayay bzrg w brtr nay pwchha kh kya myn nay tm pr kwyy zlm kya hay jw tm pr wajb tha؟ jb anhwn nay aqrar kya kh as nay nhyn kya tw khdayay bzrg w brtr nay frmaya، ''yh myra azafy ahsan hay jsay myn chahta hwn ata krta hwn۔'' bkhary nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"6284","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt myn mjh say sb say zyadh mhbt krnay walay wh lwg hwn gay jw myray dwr kay bad aayyn gay، agr wh mjhay dykh lyn tw apnay ahl w ayal awr mal qrban krnay kay lyay tyar hwn gay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6285","maawyh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”myry amt myn aysay lwg nhyn mlyn gay jw allh kay hkm kw mantay hyn، an lwgwn kay hathwn zkhmy nhyn hwn gay jw an ky mkhalft krtay hyn ya an ky mkhalft krtay hyn yhan tk kh allh ka maamlh samnay aajayay awr anhyn as halt myn nh payay۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) ans ky rwayt، \khda kay bndwn myn say...\"" ktab antqam pr mzkwr hay۔"""""
"6286","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt barsh ky mannd hay، malwm nhyn kh as ka phla ya aakhry bhtr hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"6287","jafr nay apnay wald kay hwalay say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khbr dy kh khwsh hw jao awr dwbarh khwsh hw jao، myry qwm barsh ky trh hay، malwm nhyn kh as ka aakhry ya phla bhtr hay، ya yh as bagh ky trh hay jhan say ayk lshkr kw ayk sal kay lyay khana khlaya ja skta hay، phr dwsray lshkr kw ayk sal tk khlaya ja skta hay، awr wh sb say ghra hw jw sb say ghra hw۔ awr wh qwm kysay fna hw skty hay js ka myn awl hwn، mhdy wst awr msyh aakhr hwn lykn as myn ayk tyrhy jmaat hw gy js ka myra talq nhyn hay۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6288","amrw by shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say btaya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh aap kw kn lwgwn ka ayman sb say zyadh psnd hay؟ jb yh jwab mla kh wh frshtay hyn tw aap nay frmaya kh jb wh apnay rb kay pas hyn tw wh ayman kywn nh layyn؟ yh tjwyz kya gya kh yh wh nby hyn js kay jwab myn anhwn nay kha kh jb an pr alham nazl hwta hay tw wh ayman kywn nh layyn؟ lwgwn nay apnay aap kw tjwyz kya awr aap nay frmaya kh jb myn tmharay drmyan hwn tw tm kywn yqyn nh krw؟ as nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay phr frmaya kh jn lwgwn ka ayman mjhay sb say zyadh psnd hay wh wh lwg hyn jw myray zmanay kay bad aayyn gay jn kay pas aysy ktabyn hwn gy jn myn wh ayman layyn gay۔"
"6289","abdalrhmn by۔ awf alhdrmy khtay hyn kh anhyn ayk shkhs nay btaya js nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna tha: \as lwgwn kay aakhry lwgwn myn say kchh aysay hwn gay jn kay lyay an myn say phlay kay brabr ajr hw ga، wh achhy batwn ky sfarsh kryn gay، namnasb chyzwn say mna kryn gay، awr akhtlaf krnay walwn say lryn gay۔\"" byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn dwnwn rwayat nql ky hyn۔"""""
"6290","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mbark hay wh js nay mjhay dykha، lykn sat mrtbh mbark hay wh js nay mjhay nhyn dykha lykn mjh pr ayman laya“۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"6291","abn mhyryz khtay hyn kh anhwn nay abwjmah say jw ayk shaby hyn، an say kha kh wh an kw wh bat btayyn jw anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say sny thy، tw anhwn nay jwab dya: han، myn aap kw ayk achhy rwayt snata hwn۔ ayk dn hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr abw abydh rzy allh anh kay sath khana khaya۔ aljrah nay jw hmaray sath tha pwchha kh kya hm say bhtr kwyy hay ya rswl allh js nay aslam qbwl kya hw awr aap kay sath jhad kya hw؟ as nay jwab dya kh han wh lwg jw tmharay zmanay kay bad aayyn gay awr mjhay dykhay bghyr mjh pr ayman layyn gay۔ ahmd awr darymy nay asay mntql kya، awr rzyn nay asay abw abydh kay akhtyar pr an kay pwchhnay say، \kya kwyy hm say bhtr hay، khda ka rswl...\"" say aakhr tk phnchaya۔"""""
"6292","maawyh b۔ qrh nay as byan kay lyay apnay wald kay akhtyar ka hwalh dya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \jb shamy lwg fsady hw jayyn gay tw tm myn bhlayy hw gy، lykn myry qwm kay ayk tbqay ky mdd hwty rhay gy، anhyn chhwrnay walwn kay hathwn zkhmy nhyn hwn gay، yhan tk kh aakhry ghry aajayay۔\"" abn almdyny nay kha kh yh mhdsyn hyn۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"""""
"6293","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh allh taalyٰ nay myry qwm ky ghltywn awr bhwlpn kw nzr andaz kr dya hay، awr jw kchh wh an ky mrzy kay khlaf krnay pr mjbwr hyn۔ asay abn majh awr byhqy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"6294","bhz b۔ hkym nay apnay wald ky trf say kha kh allh taalyٰ kay as qwl kay hwalay say kh ’’tm sb say bhtryn lwg thay jw bny nwa ansan kay lyay layay gyay thay،‘‘ an kay dada nay kha kh anhwn nay allh kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh ’’tm lwgwn ky tadad str tk phnchatay hw jn myn say allh taalyٰ kay nzdyk tm sb say afzl awr mazz hw۔‘‘ asay trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn rwayt hay۔"
